Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.59,0:01:03.59,Default,,0,0,0,,英文字幕来源：explosiveskull
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.59,0:01:07.03,Default,,0,0,0,,有些幸福不论地方 有些则不论时候\N{\rEng}Some cause happiness wherever  they go others whenever  they go
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.05,0:03:06.18,Default,,0,0,0,,嗨 妈\N{\rEng}Hey, Mom.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.18,0:03:08.58,Default,,0,0,0,,嗨 你哪里找来的这个陌生人？\N{\rEng}Hey! Where did you find this stranger?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.59,0:03:09.85,Default,,0,0,0,,路边捡的\N{\rEng}Found him on the road.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.85,0:03:13.12,Default,,0,0,0,,我能用一下你的车吗？我得出去一下\N{\rEng}Is it okay if I use your car? I really need to get to work.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.12,0:03:15.39,Default,,0,0,0,,- 当然 - 行吗？\N{\rEng}- [Grace] Sure. - Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.39,0:03:19.09,Default,,0,0,0,,你不想留下来帮我们做个大餐吗？\N{\rEng}You don't wanna stay and help us finish off the last of Bambi with this stew?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.10,0:03:21.83,Default,,0,0,0,,我很想 但我得走了 爸爸 谢谢你\N{\rEng}I'd love to, I have to go. Dad, thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.83,0:03:23.20,Default,,0,0,0,,好好玩\N{\rEng}[Nels] Have a good one.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.24,0:03:29.41,Default,,0,0,0,,今天咋样？\N{\rEng}How was it?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.34,0:03:32.21,Default,,0,0,0,,还行\N{\rEng}[Nels] Yeah, wasn't too bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.35,0:03:35.38,Default,,0,0,0,,嗨\N{\rEng}Hey...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.85,0:03:39.38,Default,,0,0,0,,今晚你孬好得说几句\N{\rEng}you're gonna have to say a few words tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.82,0:03:43.12,Default,,0,0,0,,几句？\N{\rEng}How many?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.36,0:03:45.79,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\rEng}Well...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.79,0:03:49.29,Default,,0,0,0,,像林肯那样 葛底斯堡演讲说了282个字\N{\rEng}Lincoln did, what,282 for the Gettysburg Address.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.29,0:03:50.73,Default,,0,0,0,,所以 100个字？\N{\rEng}So, 100?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.27,0:03:57.37,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧 他们就是想要感谢你\N{\rEng}Come on, they're just trying to thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.37,0:03:59.24,Default,,0,0,0,,又不是召集救火队\N{\rEng}It's not gonna be a firing squad.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.47,0:04:02.21,Default,,0,0,0,,那会很快结束的\N{\rEng}That would be over quick, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.49,0:04:21.69,Default,,0,0,0,,那是新的吗？\N{\rEng}Is that new?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.69,0:04:24.06,Default,,0,0,0,,不是\N{\rEng}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.50,0:04:27.17,Default,,0,0,0,,勾住那里\N{\rEng}Just tuck it there.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.73,0:04:57.23,Default,,0,0,0,,我不是个演说家\N{\rEng}Um, I'm... I'm no speech giver.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.23,0:05:02.74,Default,,0,0,0,,我非常荣幸成为Kehoe市的年度市民\N{\rEng}But I sure as heck am very honored to be named Kehoe's Citizen of the Year.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.30,0:05:05.81,Default,,0,0,0,,但是 平心而论\N{\rEng}However, if... if it were up to me...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.54,0:05:09.44,Default,,0,0,0,,还有比我更适合的人\N{\rEng}I'd give it to somebody more important.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.48,0:05:12.54,Default,,0,0,0,,呃 我是一个……\N{\rEng}Uh... I'm a...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.55,0:05:15.88,Default,,0,0,0,,我只不过是帮人们\N{\rEng}I'm just a guy who keeps a strip
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.88,0:05:19.72,Default,,0,0,0,,在雪野中清除道路的人\N{\rEng}of civilization open through the wilderness for people.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.62,0:05:23.79,Default,,0,0,0,,当你……\N{\rEng}When you...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.83,0:05:28.46,Default,,0,0,0,,当你日复一日在同一条路上开车的时候\N{\rEng}when you drive the same road day after day,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.46,0:05:34.20,Default,,0,0,0,,很容易产生找捷径的想法\N{\rEng}it's... easy to start thinking about the road not taken.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.24,0:05:39.41,Default,,0,0,0,,我竭力不那么做\N{\rEng}I try not to do that. You see...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.34,0:05:41.54,Default,,0,0,0,,我只是幸运而已\N{\rEng}I was lucky.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.28,0:05:45.65,Default,,0,0,0,,我预先选好一条安全的路\N{\rEng}I picked a good road early...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.71,0:05:48.68,Default,,0,0,0,,然后始终保持住\N{\rEng}and I stayed on it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.36,0:06:36.80,Default,,0,0,0,,嗨 小子 今天怎么样？\N{\rEng}Hey, kid. How was your day?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.97,0:06:43.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Kyle. Kyle!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.34,0:06:44.30,Default,,0,0,0,,闭嘴\N{\rEng}Shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.31,0:06:46.34,Default,,0,0,0,,-救命！ -闭嘴！\N{\rEng}- Help! - Shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.48,0:06:52.78,Default,,0,0,0,,抓住他的胳膊\N{\rEng}Get his arms!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.35,0:06:54.98,Default,,0,0,0,,- 解下他的腰带 - 我拿到了\N{\rEng}- Get his belt! - I got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.98,0:06:56.45,Default,,0,0,0,,拉下来\N{\rEng}Pull it down.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.39,0:07:01.73,Default,,0,0,0,,救命！\N{\rEng}Help!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.68,0:07:25.75,Default,,0,0,0,,妈的\N{\rEng}Shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.41,0:07:59.89,Default,,0,0,0,,- 怎么了？ - 我不想去上学\N{\rEng}- What's going on? - I don't wanna go.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.39,0:08:04.49,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道你很聪明 但你还没有那么聪明\N{\rEng}Hey, I know you're smart but you're not that smart.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.49,0:08:06.86,Default,,0,0,0,,嗨\N{\rEng}Uh, hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.13,0:08:14.77,Default,,0,0,0,,- 不想去上学\N{\rEng}-  Doesn't wanna go. - Ah, shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.90,0:08:18.77,Default,,0,0,0,,让我猜猜 是因为Tim 吗？\N{\rEng}Let me guess, this is about Tim, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.01,0:08:22.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Ryan在班上被欺负了\N{\rEng}Ryan's got a bully in his class.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.64,0:08:26.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Tim昨天弄花了他的脸\N{\rEng}Tim rubbed his face in the dirt yesterday.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.08,0:08:28.65,Default,,0,0,0,,你知道什么是欺负吗？\N{\rEng}Do you know what a bully is?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.71,0:08:31.82,Default,,0,0,0,,是一个证明你的勇气的机会\N{\rEng}It's a chance to prove your mettle.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.82,0:08:33.98,Default,,0,0,0,,现在 你不会浪费生命中的那些机会\N{\rEng}Now, you don't wanna waste those chances in life.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.99,0:08:36.69,Default,,0,0,0,,- 他被我高多了 - 就算是那样\N{\rEng}- He's a lot bigger than I am. - Yeah, even better.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.39,0:08:38.96,Default,,0,0,0,,你是说我应该揍他吗？\N{\rEng}Are you saying I should hit him?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.72,0:08:41.46,Default,,0,0,0,,本来就是啊\N{\rEng}Yeah, for a start.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.46,0:08:44.33,Default,,0,0,0,,- 那不是个好主意  -为什么不是？\N{\rEng}- That's not a very good idea. - Oh yeah, why not?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.53,0:08:47.87,Default,,0,0,0,,那样的话我就会和他一样坏了\N{\rEng}Because then I'll be as stupid as he is.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.04,0:08:50.80,Default,,0,0,0,,听着 过来\N{\rEng}Listen... come here, come here.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.11,0:08:55.57,Default,,0,0,0,,你过生日的时候我送你了《神的卷宗》\N{\rEng}I gave you Lord of the Flies for your birthday.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.58,0:08:57.84,Default,,0,0,0,,我估计你从来还没有看过\N{\rEng}I'll bet you haven't even started it yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.74,0:09:00.51,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧 那太糟糕了\N{\rEng}Well, then that's too bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.65,0:09:04.35,Default,,0,0,0,,你所需要的答案都在那本书里\N{\rEng}All the answers you'll ever need are in that book.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.88,0:09:06.65,Default,,0,0,0,,快点 到时间了\N{\rEng}Come on, time to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.60,0:09:19.97,Default,,0,0,0,,- 昨晚你可够野的\N{\rEng}-  You were a real wild man last night.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.97,0:09:23.44,Default,,0,0,0,,没人疯的过你了\N{\rEng}- There's no one crazier than you, buddy. - Who knew you could dance.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.01,0:09:33.75,Default,,0,0,0,,你看起来不错 帮你买早点去\N{\rEng}You look good. Get you some breakfast.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.87,0:10:28.64,Default,,0,0,0,,老天\N{\rEng}Grace Jesus, Grace.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.64,0:11:39.94,Default,,0,0,0,,你儿子？\N{\rEng}Your son?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.77,0:12:02.77,Default,,0,0,0,,他死于海洛因过量\N{\rEng}He died of a heroin overdose.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.99,0:12:21.99,Default,,0,0,0,,对不起\N{\rEng}Um, excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.72,0:12:26.06,Default,,0,0,0,,他不吸毒的\N{\rEng}Kyle wasn't a druggie.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.13,0:12:31.73,Default,,0,0,0,,所有父母都这么说的\N{\rEng}Sorry,but all the parents say that.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.23,0:12:35.57,Default,,0,0,0,,但是 他……他不吸毒的\N{\rEng}But he... he wasn't a druggie.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.67,0:12:38.70,Default,,0,0,0,,你在干什么？\N{\rEng}What... what are you gonna do?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.11,0:12:41.97,Default,,0,0,0,,我会把这个案子转交给缉毒组\N{\rEng}I'll be turning it over to Vice and Narcotics.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.31,0:12:46.68,Default,,0,0,0,,我们根本不了解我们的儿子\N{\rEng}We didn't know our own son.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.32,0:12:54.05,Default,,0,0,0,,他不吸毒的\N{\rEng}Kyle wasn't a druggie.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.05,0:12:56.82,Default,,0,0,0,,你就是不信\N{\rEng}You're not listening!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.05,0:13:27.39,Default,,0,0,0,,他为自己的名引领我走上正义的道路\N{\rEng}He leadeth me to the paths of righteousness for His name's sake.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.72,0:13:31.79,Default,,0,0,0,,是的 虽然我走过死亡阴影的山谷\N{\rEng}Yea, though I walk through the valley of the shadow of death,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.79,0:13:34.76,Default,,0,0,0,,我不怕灾祸 因为你与我同在\N{\rEng}I shall fear no evil for thou art with me...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.90,0:13:44.94,Default,,0,0,0,,你用圣油涂抹我的头\N{\rEng}Thou anointest my head with oil.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.87,0:13:48.31,Default,,0,0,0,,我的杯子满溢\N{\rEng}My cup runneth over.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.41,0:13:51.78,Default,,0,0,0,,善良和仁慈一定会追随我\N{\rEng}Surely goodness and mercy shall follow me
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.78,0:13:53.38,Default,,0,0,0,,我的一生一世\N{\rEng}all the days of my life.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.38,0:13:56.22,Default,,0,0,0,,我要住在耶和华的殿中 直到永远\N{\rEng}And I shall dwell in the house of the Lord forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.21,0:15:24.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Nels?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.04,0:15:27.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Dante?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.31,0:15:29.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Dante?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.88,0:15:31.32,Default,,0,0,0,,对不起\N{\rEng}I'm sorry, Nels.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.32,0:15:35.85,Default,,0,0,0,,我真的对不起\N{\rEng}I'm really sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.35,0:15:38.22,Default,,0,0,0,,本来不应该搞成这样子的\N{\rEng}It wasn't supposed to end like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.46,0:15:44.26,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道可卡因何时何地到达\N{\rEng}I know where and when the cocaine arrives.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.53,0:15:51.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Kyle什么也不知道 真的\N{\rEng}Kyle didn't know about any of this. That's the truth.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.30,0:15:54.30,Default,,0,0,0,,就一包而已\N{\rEng}It was just one bag.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.31,0:15:56.14,Default,,0,0,0,,就一包而已\N{\rEng}Just one bag!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.34,0:16:00.88,Default,,0,0,0,,但是那些人总是会发现（少了一包）\N{\rEng}But people like that, they always find out.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.88,0:16:03.81,Default,,0,0,0,,慢点 什么人？\N{\rEng}Wait a minute, What people?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.58,0:16:07.32,Default,,0,0,0,,你说的是什么人？\N{\rEng}What people do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.99,0:16:15.03,Default,,0,0,0,,你有……有钱吗？\N{\rEng}Do you have...do you have any cash?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.06,0:16:19.03,Default,,0,0,0,,- 如果他们找到 他们不会放过我的  -什么人？\N{\rEng}- If they find me, they'll hurt me! - What people!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.03,0:16:22.17,Default,,0,0,0,,你说的是什么人？\N{\rEng}- [sobs] Please! Please! - What people do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.17,0:16:24.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Speedo 一个叫做Speedo的人\N{\rEng}there's a guy named Speedo.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.10,0:16:25.90,Default,,0,0,0,,我只知道他叫Speedo\N{\rEng}-  Speedo?- He's the only one I know!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.90,0:16:27.60,Default,,0,0,0,,告诉我哪里能找到他？\N{\rEng}Just tell me where I can find this guy
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.61,0:16:30.24,Default,,0,0,0,,你就能从这里滚蛋了\N{\rEng}and then you get the hell out of here!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.24,0:16:30.88,Default,,0,0,0,,他在哪里？\N{\rEng}Where is he?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.02,0:18:15.62,Default,,0,0,0,,你就是Speedo？\N{\rEng}So, you're Speedo?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.45,0:18:18.29,Default,,0,0,0,,对喽\N{\rEng}Bingo, gold star.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.62,0:18:23.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Dante让我来的\N{\rEng}Dante says hello.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.23,0:18:28.03,Default,,0,0,0,,我不认识啥Dante\N{\rEng}I don't know any Dantes.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.40,0:18:30.37,Default,,0,0,0,,当然你认识\N{\rEng}Yes, you do.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.00,0:18:36.17,Default,,0,0,0,,他和我儿子Kyle都在机场工作\N{\rEng}He worked at the Kehoe airport with my son... Kyle.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.37,0:18:38.71,Default,,0,0,0,,你也认识他的\N{\rEng}You know him too.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.25,0:18:44.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Kyle?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.18,0:18:49.08,Default,,0,0,0,,呃 Kyle是你的儿子？\N{\rEng}Oh, yeah.Kyle, that's your kid?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.62,0:18:53.19,Default,,0,0,0,,我不认识他\N{\rEng}No, I don't know him. Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.66,0:18:57.09,Default,,0,0,0,,我认识很多人 也认识很多叫做Kyle的\N{\rEng}I know a lot of people, I know a lot of... Kyles.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.73,0:18:59.30,Default,,0,0,0,,告诉我怎么回事？\N{\rEng}Tell me what happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.60,0:19:09.14,Default,,0,0,0,,告诉我\N{\rEng}Tell me.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.14,0:19:11.61,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧 老爸 那里是门 对吧？\N{\rEng}All right, Pops.There's the door, all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.61,0:19:15.05,Default,,0,0,0,,你从哪里来就滚回哪里去吧\N{\rEng}I don't know what igloo you crawled out of but I think it's time you crawled back in.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.41,0:19:19.58,Default,,0,0,0,,相信我 那是你最好的选择\N{\rEng}And trust me,that's your, uh, best move.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.12,0:19:24.19,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧？\N{\rEng}Okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.25,0:19:57.05,Default,,0,0,0,,你拿了我的手机？\N{\rEng}You have my phone?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.19,0:20:03.46,Default,,0,0,0,,告诉我怎么回事\N{\rEng}Tell me what happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.41,0:20:15.64,Default,,0,0,0,,我只是\N{\rEng}I was...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.54,0:20:18.51,Default,,0,0,0,,我只是执行命令\N{\rEng}I was just taking orders.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.51,0:20:20.11,Default,,0,0,0,,谁的命令？\N{\rEng}Taking orders from who?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.51,0:20:21.55,Default,,0,0,0,,谁的？\N{\rEng}Who!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.21,0:20:24.15,Default,,0,0,0,,- Limbo  - 嗯?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.82,0:20:26.79,Default,,0,0,0,,- Limbo  - Limbo?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.89,0:20:29.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Limbo
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.39,0:20:30.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Limbo
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.42,0:20:32.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Limbo...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.53,0:20:37.66,Default,,0,0,0,,是他吗？\N{\rEng}Is that him? That Limbo?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.20,0:21:47.23,Default,,0,0,0,,毫无疑问 Dan Reeves至少是排名前三的教练\N{\rEng}[radio host] No doubt about it, Dan Reeves was at least in the top three best coaches.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.23,0:21:50.70,Default,,0,0,0,,只要我们回顾一下Mile High体育馆的历史\N{\rEng}And since we're strolling down memory lane at the Mile High Stadium,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.71,0:21:53.37,Default,,0,0,0,,最后问丹佛球迷一个问题\N{\rEng}here's a late night question for you, Denver.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.37,0:21:56.44,Default,,0,0,0,,谁是最伟大的四分卫\N{\rEng}Elway or Manning?Greatest quarterback ever, Elway or Manning?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.44,0:21:59.78,Default,,0,0,0,,请拨打热线发表你的看法\N{\rEng}Give me a call on 555-2395.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.78,0:22:00.82,Default,,0,0,0,,谁也不是\N{\rEng}Nobody
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.00,0:22:53.27,Default,,0,0,0,,难道你不问我去哪里了吗？\N{\rEng}Aren't you gonna ask where I've been?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.95,0:23:06.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Speedo不见了\N{\rEng}Uh, Speedo's missing.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.46,0:23:21.23,Default,,0,0,0,,谁是Speedo？\N{\rEng}Who's Speedo?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.70,0:23:24.57,Default,,0,0,0,,我的一个员工 你不用知道他\N{\rEng}One of my employees. But you wouldn't know about him,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.57,0:23:28.54,Default,,0,0,0,,因为我们在上学路上不谈工作 对吧？\N{\rEng}because we don't talk about business on the way to school, do we?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.78,0:23:40.22,Default,,0,0,0,,谁打包的这些？\N{\rEng}Who packed these?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.95,0:23:46.02,Default,,0,0,0,,-  不觉得对他不好啊 -高果糖玉米糖浆\N{\rEng}- Didn't think a treat would kill him. - High fructose corn syrup.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.02,0:23:47.46,Default,,0,0,0,,卵磷脂\N{\rEng}Lecithin.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.09,0:23:49.53,Default,,0,0,0,,烘焙苏打？\N{\rEng}Baking soda?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.50,0:23:53.73,Default,,0,0,0,,这里面就差再加点老鼠药了\N{\rEng}The only thing not in those is rat poison.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.34,0:23:58.60,Default,,0,0,0,,我想让你知道\N{\rEng}I want you to know...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.74,0:24:01.44,Default,,0,0,0,,我没有插手这事\N{\rEng}I had no hand in this.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:09.75,0:24:11.72,Default,,0,0,0,,我说了让它们都合法化\N{\rEng}I say make them all legal.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:12.45,0:24:13.99,Default,,0,0,0,,甲基苯丙胺 前鸦片\N{\rEng}Meth, ex, opium.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:15.85,0:24:18.89,Default,,0,0,0,,每个商场都设专柜\N{\rEng}An opium den in every mall, that's my platform.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:20.96,0:24:25.93,Default,,0,0,0,,给这些人毒品 抽税 然后给我们加薪\N{\rEng}Give the people what they want. Tax theshit out of it, then double our pay.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:27.97,0:24:30.70,Default,,0,0,0,,你觉得怎么样？ - 走好不送\N{\rEng}- What do you think about that? - [female officer] No thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:30.70,0:24:35.51,Default,,0,0,0,,我希望能看出来谁好谁坏 那样我就知道该射谁了\N{\rEng}I wanna be able to tell the good guys from the bad guys. That way I'll know who to shoot.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:39.68,0:24:41.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Nels Coxman
Dialogue: 0,0:24:42.02,0:24:43.68,Default,,0,0,0,,年度市民\N{\rEng}Citizen of the Year.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:44.78,0:24:46.29,Default,,0,0,0,,好样的\N{\rEng}Good for him.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:49.86,0:24:52.42,Default,,0,0,0,,这是个现实世界 你懂的 鸡巴男\N{\rEng}It's a real word, you know, cocksman. 
Dialogue: 0,0:24:52.76,0:24:56.43,Default,,0,0,0,,意思是“擅长意乱艺术的男人”\N{\rEng}It means "a man adept at the art of fornication."
Dialogue: 0,0:24:56.43,0:24:57.46,Default,,0,0,0,,还行\N{\rEng}Nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:01.63,0:25:02.63,Default,,0,0,0,,你看到这些人了？\N{\rEng}You see these guys?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:07.87,0:25:10.04,Default,,0,0,0,,哇\N{\rEng}Whoa. Whoa, hey...
Dialogue: 0,0:25:10.04,0:25:12.01,Default,,0,0,0,,不过是大麻而已\N{\rEng}- It's just weed.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:13.15,0:25:15.75,Default,,0,0,0,,- 是可以合法购买的 - 但在家用才合法\N{\rEng}Yeah, it's legal to purchase, legal to smoke at home.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:15.75,0:25:17.92,Default,,0,0,0,,歇会儿吧\N{\rEng}Take a breath.Come on, breathe.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:17.92,0:25:20.42,Default,,0,0,0,,如果想要在Kehoe执法队伍里混下去\N{\rEng}There's a principle you need to get on board with
Dialogue: 0,0:25:20.42,0:25:24.52,Default,,0,0,0,,有个原则你得了解\N{\rEng}if you intend to survive and advance in Kehoe law enforcement.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:24.52,0:25:26.69,Default,,0,0,0,,那就是警民鱼水情\N{\rEng}It's called community policing.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:26.69,0:25:31.63,Default,,0,0,0,,我们得拥抱 得融入我们的社区价值\N{\rEng}Wherein we embrace and enforce the values of our community.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:31.63,0:25:33.83,Default,,0,0,0,,拥抱他们竖起的中指？\N{\rEng}The values of them giving us the finger?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:33.83,0:25:38.80,Default,,0,0,0,,我们是个滑雪城镇 大家来这里就是放松找乐子\N{\rEng}We're a ski town. Folks come here to ski, have sex and get high.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:38.81,0:25:40.67,Default,,0,0,0,,所以 看开点\N{\rEng}So lighten up.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:40.67,0:25:42.61,Default,,0,0,0,,你想要当神探哈利吗？\N{\rEng}- Here, you wanna get your Dirty Harry on?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:46.58,0:25:48.05,Default,,0,0,0,,看那个停车表到时间了\N{\rEng}The meter just hit zero.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:49.15,0:25:50.68,Default,,0,0,0,,别嚼口香糖了\N{\rEng}Get rid of the gum.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:49.51,0:26:51.75,Default,,0,0,0,,老板 有什么吩咐？\N{\rEng}So, what can I do for you, boss?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:51.75,0:26:53.51,Default,,0,0,0,,呃 我是……\N{\rEng}Uh, I'm...
Dialogue: 0,0:26:53.52,0:26:55.68,Default,,0,0,0,,失陪一会儿\N{\rEng}- I'll be right with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:55.69,0:26:57.79,Default,,0,0,0,,稍等片刻\N{\rEng}- Give me one second.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:00.52,0:27:01.99,Default,,0,0,0,,最后的决定是什么？\N{\rEng}What's the verdict back here?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:27.75,0:27:30.55,Default,,0,0,0,,我会帮你们免费去掉纱\N{\rEng}I'll throw in the veil at no extra charge.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:32.12,0:27:34.16,Default,,0,0,0,,- 恭喜 - 感谢\N{\rEng}- Congratulations. - [woman] Thanks for everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:39.10,0:27:41.13,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧 有什么需要帮忙的 老板？\N{\rEng}All right.How can I help you, boss?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:42.23,0:27:46.90,Default,,0,0,0,,我想找 tux\N{\rEng}Uh, I'm, uh,I'm looking for a tux.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:48.67,0:27:51.14,Default,,0,0,0,,我就是 婚礼是什么时候？\N{\rEng}You got it. When is the wedding?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:54.15,0:27:56.61,Default,,0,0,0,,不是婚礼 我的……\N{\rEng}It's not a wedding. My...
Dialogue: 0,0:27:57.22,0:28:00.99,Default,,0,0,0,,我的妻子和我重新宣誓\N{\rEng}my wife and I,we're renewing our vows.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:04.22,0:28:05.89,Default,,0,0,0,,依然浓烈 是吗？\N{\rEng}Still going strong, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:08.06,0:28:09.63,Default,,0,0,0,,美事一桩\N{\rEng}That's what I like to hear.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:10.86,0:28:13.63,Default,,0,0,0,,先量一下尺寸怎么样？ 当然\N{\rEng}- How's about we get you measured, huh?\- Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:21.87,0:28:23.77,Default,,0,0,0,,你杀了我儿子\N{\rEng}You killed my boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:23.78,0:28:26.05,Default,,0,0,0,,谁让你做的？\N{\rEng}- Who told you to do it?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:31.35,0:28:32.38,Default,,0,0,0,,谁？\N{\rEng}Who?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:32.38,0:28:34.18,Default,,0,0,0,,圣诞佬\N{\rEng}Santa. Santa.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:34.19,0:28:36.22,Default,,0,0,0,,- "圣诞佬"？  - 都这么叫他\N{\rEng}- "Santa"? - That's what he goes by.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:39.83,0:28:41.56,Default,,0,0,0,,我怎么才能找到这个"圣诞佬" Where can I find this "Santa"?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:46.70,0:28:48.97,Default,,0,0,0,,在Kehoe有个小机场\N{\rEng}There's a little airport in Kehoe.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:48.97,0:28:51.14,Default,,0,0,0,,他把毒品带进去 再把钱带出来\N{\rEng}He flies in with the coke and out with the money.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:51.14,0:28:52.60,Default,,0,0,0,,他长什么样？\N{\rEng}What does he look like?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:53.17,0:28:54.84,Default,,0,0,0,,他长得就像个圣诞老人\N{\rEng}He looks like a Santa.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:56.21,0:29:00.24,Default,,0,0,0,,- 不要啊  别杀我 - 你不必杀我的儿子的\N{\rEng}- No! Come on, please. -You don't have to do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:09.02,0:29:10.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Elway 还是 Manning?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:14.76,0:29:15.86,Default,,0,0,0,,什么？\N{\rEng}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:16.36,0:29:19.90,Default,,0,0,0,,最伟大的四分卫 你选哪个？\N{\rEng}Greatest quarterback ever. Elway or Manning?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:26.11,0:29:27.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Elway
Dialogue: 0,0:30:09.99,0:30:12.65,Default,,0,0,0,,你知道儿子有脸书吗？\N{\rEng}Did you know Kyle had a Facebook?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:17.13,0:30:18.76,Default,,0,0,0,,你知道他喜欢的乐队吗？\N{\rEng}Do you know his favorite band?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:23.00,0:30:25.73,Default,,0,0,0,,他最喜欢的电影 你了解这些吗？\N{\rEng}He posted his favorite movies, do you know those?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:30.04,0:30:33.08,Default,,0,0,0,,你们打猎时候都聊些什么？\N{\rEng}What'd the two of you talk about on your damn hunting trips?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:38.31,0:30:39.32,Default,,0,0,0,,聊打猎\N{\rEng}Hunting.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:53.00,0:30:54.03,Default,,0,0,0,,妈的\N{\rEng}Damn it.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:54.36,0:30:55.40,Default,,0,0,0,,妈的\N{\rEng}Goddamn.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:03.34,0:31:04.31,Default,,0,0,0,,妈的\N{\rEng}Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:08.38,0:31:10.18,Default,,0,0,0,,那是你丢的第四个运动包\N{\rEng}That's the fourth gym bag you've lost.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:10.18,0:31:11.71,Default,,0,0,0,,谁会数这个呢？\N{\rEng}Yeah,but who's counting, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:14.32,0:31:16.32,Default,,0,0,0,,你会觉得很难相信\N{\rEng}You might find this hard to believe
Dialogue: 0,0:31:16.32,0:31:18.99,Default,,0,0,0,,我有比看住运动包更重要的事情要做\N{\rEng}but I've got more important things to do than keep track of gym bags.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:18.99,0:31:21.73,Default,,0,0,0,,比如挣到买包的钱\N{\rEng}Like earning the money to pay for them.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:22.19,0:31:23.26,Default,,0,0,0,,干脆这样吧\N{\rEng}Tell you what...
Dialogue: 0,0:31:23.53,0:31:25.39,Default,,0,0,0,,拿着这个\N{\rEng}why don't you take this
Dialogue: 0,0:31:25.40,0:31:29.26,Default,,0,0,0,,帮他买下所有他需要的包\N{\rEng}and buy him every single goddamn gym bag he'll ever need.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:29.27,0:31:30.47,Default,,0,0,0,,这样行了吗？\N{\rEng}Does that work for you?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:34.47,0:31:35.77,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\rEng}All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:36.27,0:31:37.77,Default,,0,0,0,,这是给你的\N{\rEng}Well, that's for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:40.18,0:31:42.31,Default,,0,0,0,,-这是开玩笑吧 - 不是\N{\rEng}- Tell me this is a joke. - No.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:42.31,0:31:44.32,Default,,0,0,0,,那是Ryan 的新食谱 你得按照这个来\N{\rEng}That's Ryan's new diet. And you're gonna follow it to the letter.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:44.58,0:31:47.58,Default,,0,0,0,,早餐：草饲牛肉 芦笋 腰果\N{\rEng}Breakfast: grass-fed beef, asparagus, cashews.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:47.59,0:31:50.09,Default,,0,0,0,,午餐 同上 晚餐 同上\N{\rEng}Lunch, the same. Dinner, the same.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:50.09,0:31:53.32,Default,,0,0,0,,那是周一的食谱 周二轮换为鸡肉、花菜、杏仁\N{\rEng}Yeah, that's on Mondays. Tuesday it rotates. Chicken, broccoli and almonds.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:53.32,0:31:54.96,Default,,0,0,0,,一日三餐？\N{\rEng}For breakfast, lunch and dinner?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:56.43,0:31:59.00,Default,,0,0,0,,你希望我们的儿子三餐吃一样的？\N{\rEng}You want our son to eat the same thing three times a day?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:59.00,0:32:02.06,Default,,0,0,0,,百分之八十的免疫系统作用于肠道\N{\rEng}Eighty percent of our immune system starts in the gut.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:02.07,0:32:04.97,Default,,0,0,0,,简化肠道负担 可以长命百岁\N{\rEng}Keep it simple in the gut, you get to live a long life.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:04.97,0:32:07.37,Default,,0,0,0,,一周吃这个 还不如弄死他\N{\rEng}A week on this diet and he'll wanna kill himself.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:08.01,0:32:09.37,Default,,0,0,0,,我会帮他的\N{\rEng}And I'll help him do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:09.38,0:32:11.24,Default,,0,0,0,,你应该心存感激的\N{\rEng}You know what, you should be grateful.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:12.81,0:32:16.31,Default,,0,0,0,,我爸爸给我半个葡萄柚和3条毒品当早餐的\N{\rEng}My dad started my day with half a grapefruit and three lines of primo coke.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:16.32,0:32:18.35,Default,,0,0,0,,他称之为“冠军早餐”\N{\rEng}"Breakfast of champions," he called it.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:18.35,0:32:21.79,Default,,0,0,0,,现在你儿子连看一眼糖果店都不行\N{\rEng}And now your son can't look at a candy bar without breaking into hives.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:22.42,0:32:24.89,Default,,0,0,0,,恭喜 你已经打破了怪圈\N{\rEng}Congratulations, you've broken the cycle.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:25.96,0:32:27.03,Default,,0,0,0,,再考虑一下\N{\rEng}And to think...
Dialogue: 0,0:32:31.03,0:32:33.37,Default,,0,0,0,,我过去爱的是这张嘴\N{\rEng}I used to love the mouth on you.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:34.43,0:32:36.07,Default,,0,0,0,,我和律师谈过了\N{\rEng}I've spoken to my lawyer.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:37.04,0:32:39.97,Default,,0,0,0,,我们想要修改一下协议 10天跟我 4天跟你\N{\rEng}We want a new arrangement. Ten days with me, four with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:43.54,0:32:47.58,Default,,0,0,0,,这是我的方案 14天我带 你一天都没有\N{\rEng}Here's my counter offer. Fourteen days with me and none with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:47.58,0:32:49.85,Default,,0,0,0,,然后看你的律师怎么办？\N{\rEng}Let's see what your lawyer thinks about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:54.89,0:32:56.86,Default,,0,0,0,,-早 Aya - 嗨 Mustang\N{\rEng}- Morning, Aya. - Hey, Mustang.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:04.43,0:33:06.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Limbo不见了\N{\rEng}They say Limbo's disappeared.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:20.98,0:33:22.98,Default,,0,0,0,,不用担心 他能处理的\N{\rEng}Don't worry about it, he'll get over it.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:26.52,0:33:27.89,Default,,0,0,0,,那是莫扎特吗？\N{\rEng}Is that Mozart?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:29.19,0:33:33.06,Default,,0,0,0,,巴赫 很容易分辨的 他很有数学思维的\N{\rEng}Bach. You can always tell Bach because he's really mathematical.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:34.26,0:33:36.60,Default,,0,0,0,,- 是那个有很多孩子的人吗？ - 是的 20个\N{\rEng}- Is he the one with all the kids? - Yeah, 20.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:40.33,0:33:42.47,Default,,0,0,0,,还能有时间作曲真是个奇迹\N{\rEng}It's a wonder he found any time to compose.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:43.30,0:33:45.44,Default,,0,0,0,,我需要你指点我一下 梦幻足球\N{\rEng}I need your help with my fantasy football.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:46.24,0:33:48.28,Default,,0,0,0,,我一把也赢不了\N{\rEng}I can't... I can't win a game.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:52.11,0:33:53.21,Default,,0,0,0,,玩钱的吗？\N{\rEng}Playing for money?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:55.22,0:33:57.42,Default,,0,0,0,,当然是玩钱的\N{\rEng}Yeah, of course. I'm playing for money.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:00.12,0:34:02.56,Default,,0,0,0,,你选了4次克利夫兰Browns队了\N{\rEng}You got four Cleveland Browns on your team.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:03.49,0:34:04.99,Default,,0,0,0,,他们是我的主队\N{\rEng}Well, they're my home team.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:06.13,0:34:07.56,Default,,0,0,0,,不忠诚还算什么男人？\N{\rEng}What's a man without loyalty?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:10.53,0:34:12.10,Default,,0,0,0,,真帮不了你\N{\rEng}I can't help you.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:54.41,0:35:56.67,Default,,0,0,0,,过不去了\N{\rEng}Hey, there's not enough room to pass,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:56.67,0:36:00.01,Default,,0,0,0,,不知道你能否退回去？\N{\rEng}I was wondering if you'd back down to the turnoff?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:07.19,0:36:09.05,Default,,0,0,0,,能通融一下吗？\N{\rEng}Any chance you could back up?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:12.46,0:36:15.46,Default,,0,0,0,,就我们两人 对吧？\N{\rEng}Um, just between you and me,right?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:16.19,0:36:17.53,Default,,0,0,0,,你 我\N{\rEng}Me, you and frosty.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:19.13,0:36:20.13,Default,,0,0,0,,当然\N{\rEng}Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:29.44,0:36:33.58,Default,,0,0,0,,你不知道你惹了谁了\N{\rEng}You have no clue who you're messing with, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:33.58,0:36:35.05,Default,,0,0,0,,我惹了谁了？\N{\rEng}Who am I messing with?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:37.12,0:36:39.22,Default,,0,0,0,,你微不足道\N{\rEng}You're dust, pal.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:47.53,0:36:48.56,Default,,0,0,0,,告诉我\N{\rEng}Tell me.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:50.80,0:36:53.43,Default,,0,0,0,,你在浪费你的时间\N{\rEng}You're wasting your time.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:07.21,0:37:10.42,Default,,0,0,0,,你累了吗 老头？\N{\rEng}Are you tired, old man?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:14.19,0:37:15.19,Default,,0,0,0,,是的\N{\rEng}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:41.68,0:37:45.62,Default,,0,0,0,,♪ He's gone
Dialogue: 0,0:37:45.62,0:37:49.69,Default,,0,0,0,,♪ Two thousand miles
Dialogue: 0,0:37:50.76,0:37:52.79,Default,,0,0,0,,♪ It's very far
Dialogue: 0,0:37:56.33,0:38:00.23,Default,,0,0,0,,♪ The snow is falling down
Dialogue: 0,0:38:00.67,0:38:03.71,Default,,0,0,0,,♪ Gets colder day by day
Dialogue: 0,0:38:05.31,0:38:07.68,Default,,0,0,0,,♪ I miss you
Dialogue: 0,0:38:11.58,0:38:14.28,Default,,0,0,0,,♪ The children will sing
Dialogue: 0,0:38:14.92,0:38:18.65,Default,,0,0,0,,♪ He'll be back At Christmas time ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:38:27.40,0:38:28.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Grace?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:30.73,0:38:31.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Grace?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:52.45,0:39:53.85,Default,,0,0,0,,你来干嘛？\N{\rEng}What are you doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:55.75,0:39:56.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Kyle死了\N{\rEng}Kyle's dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:58.82,0:40:00.02,Default,,0,0,0,,有人杀了他\N{\rEng}Somebody killed him.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:01.39,0:40:02.89,Default,,0,0,0,,我能做什么？\N{\rEng}What's that got to do with me?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:04.10,0:40:05.46,Default,,0,0,0,,我能进来吗？\N{\rEng}Can I come in?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:13.87,0:40:17.68,Default,,0,0,0,,最好拖鞋 不然她活剥了你\N{\rEng}Better take your shoes off. She'llskin you alive. [越南话]
Dialogue: 0,0:40:18.68,0:40:20.64,Default,,0,0,0,,我打几个电话问问\N{\rEng}I'm going to make some phone calls.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:20.65,0:40:22.35,Default,,0,0,0,,看看到底怎么回事\N{\rEng}Find out what happened to Kyle.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:56.62,0:40:59.09,Default,,0,0,0,,她觉得你是以前的那伙人\N{\rEng}She thinks you're one of the guys from the old days.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:59.62,0:41:00.69,Default,,0,0,0,,别管她\N{\rEng}Don't worry about her.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:02.02,0:41:06.49,Default,,0,0,0,,一些傻叉把Kyle和Dante搞混了\N{\rEng}Kyle. He got mixed up with some clown by the name of Dante.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:06.79,0:41:09.56,Default,,0,0,0,,他们从维京人那里偷了1公斤毒品\N{\rEng}And they stole a kilo of coke from Viking.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:09.56,0:41:12.47,Default,,0,0,0,,- 谁是维京人？ -一个大毒枭\N{\rEng}- Who's Viking? - Drug dealer. A big one.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:12.90,0:41:16.47,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你认识他妈？ - 是的 他穿开裆裤的时候就认识\N{\rEng}- You know him? - Yeah, when he was a snot-nosed kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:16.94,0:41:20.61,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我认识他老爸 Bullitt - 老爹也认识他？\N{\rEng} - I knew his old man, Bullitt. - Dad knew him, too?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:20.61,0:41:25.05,Default,,0,0,0,,无论Bullitt有什么脏活要做 首选的就是老爹 我\N{\rEng}Whenever Bullitt had rough stuff to be done, that was his go-to guy. After Dad, me.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:25.75,0:41:27.51,Default,,0,0,0,,然后维京人接管了\N{\rEng}And then Viking took over.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:27.92,0:41:30.08,Default,,0,0,0,,维京人的路数完全不同\N{\rEng}Viking's a whole different breed.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:30.08,0:41:31.79,Default,,0,0,0,,他喜欢追杀人\N{\rEng}He likes hurting people.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:34.19,0:41:35.89,Default,,0,0,0,,我要杀了他\N{\rEng}I'm gonna kill him, Brock.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:38.93,0:41:40.06,Default,,0,0,0,,你当然会\N{\rEng}Sure you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:41.73,0:41:43.73,Default,,0,0,0,,什么会让觉得自己能杀人？\N{\rEng}What makes you think you can kill a man?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:48.07,0:41:49.07,Default,,0,0,0,,我已经……\N{\rEng}I've...
Dialogue: 0,0:41:49.90,0:41:52.01,Default,,0,0,0,,我已经杀了他的三个手下了\N{\rEng}I've killed three of his guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:53.61,0:41:55.41,Default,,0,0,0,,你怎么处理的尸体？\N{\rEng}What did you do with the bodies?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:55.88,0:41:58.85,Default,,0,0,0,,用铁丝网圈起来扔进河谷里了\N{\rEng}Wrapped them in chicken wire, threw them on the gorge.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:00.92,0:42:03.85,Default,,0,0,0,,- 铁丝网？ - 是的 这样鱼就能吃掉他们了\N{\rEng}- Chicken wire? - Yeah, to let the fish get at them.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:03.85,0:42:06.45,Default,,0,0,0,,他们将会吃掉所有的肉\N{\rEng}They'll eat the flesh off the bones.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:06.45,0:42:08.72,Default,,0,0,0,,所以尸体不会因为产生气体浮起来\N{\rEng}So the bodies don't fill with gas and rise.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:08.72,0:42:10.66,Default,,0,0,0,,- 他们会待在河底\N{\rEng}- They stay at the bottom. - [chuckles]
Dialogue: 0,0:42:12.56,0:42:16.10,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你咋知道的？ - 我在侦探小说里读到的\N{\rEng}- Where did you learn that? - I read it in a crime novel.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:29.78,0:42:32.55,Default,,0,0,0,,- 他是我兄弟  - 兄弟？\N{\rEng}- [Brock] He is my brother. - Brother? [scoffs]
Dialogue: 0,0:42:33.22,0:42:34.55,Default,,0,0,0,,兄弟个屁\N{\rEng}My ass.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:39.76,0:42:42.49,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道\N{\rEng}I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:49.80,0:42:51.57,Default,,0,0,0,,- 也许我该…… - 闭嘴\N{\rEng}- [Nels] Maybe I should... - Shut up.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:58.11,0:42:59.58,Default,,0,0,0,,别惹麻烦\N{\rEng}You stay out of trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:03.51,0:43:05.52,Default,,0,0,0,,都是为了爱\N{\rEng}The things we do for love, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:06.15,0:43:08.75,Default,,0,0,0,,她在按摩椅收银台揩油\N{\rEng}She was skimming the till at a massage parlor.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:08.75,0:43:11.09,Default,,0,0,0,,他们派我去收拾她 然后……\N{\rEng}They sent me to beat the shit out of her. Instead...
Dialogue: 0,0:43:12.09,0:43:13.19,Default,,0,0,0,,你老婆还好吗？\N{\rEng}How's Grace?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:15.09,0:43:16.59,Default,,0,0,0,,她走了\N{\rEng}She left.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:17.53,0:43:19.83,Default,,0,0,0,,那女人做的是时候 我能理解\N{\rEng}The lady's got good timing, I'll give her that.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:19.83,0:43:21.53,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么找到这个维京人？\N{\rEng}How do I find this Viking?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:22.53,0:43:23.50,Default,,0,0,0,,你找不到的\N{\rEng}You don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:24.90,0:43:28.77,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你挖的已经够深了 - 拭目以待吧\N{\rEng}- You've gone as far up the ladder as you're gonna go. - We'll see.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:30.24,0:43:33.68,Default,,0,0,0,,没了一个算是意外 少两个肯定有问题了\N{\rEng}One guy can disappear. Two? I don't think so.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:33.68,0:43:36.71,Default,,0,0,0,,三个？还是带着10包货？\N{\rEng}Three? With ten keys of coke?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:37.32,0:43:39.48,Default,,0,0,0,,也许他们是合谋的\N{\rEng}Maybe they were all in it together.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:46.99,0:43:49.83,Default,,0,0,0,,你觉得他们三个卷我的货跑路了？\N{\rEng}You think three of my dealers ran out on me?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:50.76,0:43:54.67,Default,,0,0,0,,照你这么说 我对手下一无所知？\N{\rEng}That would make me the worst judge of character in the Rockies, that's your theory?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:57.64,0:43:58.80,Default,,0,0,0,,- 不是 -不是\N{\rEng}- [Dexter] No. - No.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:03.07,0:44:06.01,Default,,0,0,0,,应该是那些该死的印第安人\N{\rEng}It was those goddamn Indians.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:06.01,0:44:08.64,Default,,0,0,0,,都是我老爸当年为了和他们共处犯的错\N{\rEng}This is all my father's fault for getting into bed with them.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:08.65,0:44:10.15,Default,,0,0,0,,对不起 印第安人？\N{\rEng}I'm sorry, the Indians?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:10.15,0:44:12.15,Default,,0,0,0,,维京人的爸爸当年创业的时候\N{\rEng}When Viking's father was first getting started,
Dialogue: 0,0:44:12.15,0:44:14.72,Default,,0,0,0,,和一个叫做白牛印第安人达成了交易\N{\rEng}he made a deal with an Indian named White Bull.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:14.72,0:44:17.02,Default,,0,0,0,,他给白牛供货 让他在保留区里卖货\N{\rEng}He supplied him, White Bull dealt on the reservation.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:17.02,0:44:19.29,Default,,0,0,0,,直到白牛希望拿到更多的地盘\N{\rEng}Until White Bull wanted more turf.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:19.29,0:44:23.06,Default,,0,0,0,,- 于是他就把一些不值钱的地块给了白牛 - 比如Kehoe市\N{\rEng}- So he tossed White Bull a few piece of crap towns. - [Mustang] Like Kehoe.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:23.06,0:44:26.73,Default,,0,0,0,,但是Kehoe市修建了滑雪道 成了一个聚宝盆\N{\rEng}And Kehoe builds a ski resort. Turns it into a gold mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:27.17,0:44:30.10,Default,,0,0,0,,我们学到了什么历史教训？\N{\rEng}What's the one thing history's taught us?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:30.10,0:44:33.21,Default,,0,0,0,,你给了那些印第安人保留区\N{\rEng}You keep those Indians on the reservation.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:34.21,0:44:37.67,Default,,0,0,0,,他们总是还要更多的地方\N{\rEng}Those Indians,they're always wanting more.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:37.68,0:44:40.05,Default,,0,0,0,,因为他们觉得这些地盘本该是他们的\N{\rEng}Because they think the turf was theirs all along.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:40.31,0:44:42.21,Default,,0,0,0,,有些道理\N{\rEng}Might kinda have a point there, right.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:56.70,0:44:59.13,Default,,0,0,0,,白牛送了这个给我爸爸\N{\rEng}White Bull gave this to my father...
Dialogue: 0,0:45:00.00,0:45:02.07,Default,,0,0,0,,就在他们达成协议的那天\N{\rEng}the day they shook on their deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:03.80,0:45:04.91,Default,,0,0,0,,是的\N{\rEng}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:06.31,0:45:08.34,Default,,0,0,0,,该是我们把它还回去的时候了\N{\rEng}It's time we give it back to him.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:15.68,0:45:19.78,Default,,0,0,0,,- 两位有什么需要吗？ - 和我们坐一会儿 聊聊\N{\rEng}- What can I do for you two? - You could sit down with us. Tell us your story.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:19.79,0:45:24.26,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我还得服务其他客人 - 可是我的眼里只有你\N{\rEng}- I got other customers. - Yeah, that's funny. All I can see in here is you.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:24.96,0:45:26.89,Default,,0,0,0,,请告诉我你上夜班\N{\rEng}Please tell me you work nights.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:27.36,0:45:29.30,Default,,0,0,0,,周四 怎么了？\N{\rEng}Thursdays. Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:29.30,0:45:32.16,Default,,0,0,0,,你太耀眼了 我得晚上才能看的清楚\N{\rEng}You look this good in sunlight, I gotta see you after dark.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:32.17,0:45:35.24,Default,,0,0,0,,鸡蛋、培根、煎饼\N{\rEng}- Eggs, bacon, pancakes.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:35.77,0:45:36.87,Default,,0,0,0,,你点什么？\N{\rEng}And for you?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:37.31,0:45:40.07,Default,,0,0,0,,帮我点一下\N{\rEng}Surprise me.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:41.04,0:45:42.08,Default,,0,0,0,,好的\N{\rEng}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:43.38,0:45:46.85,Default,,0,0,0,,我13岁是我爸爸死的时候对我说过\N{\rEng}I was 13 when my dad kicked it. You know his last words to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:46.85,0:45:49.65,Default,,0,0,0,,尽量撩每个人女服务员\N{\rEng}"Try to bang every waitress who ever serves you."
Dialogue: 0,0:45:55.32,0:45:58.93,Default,,0,0,0,,这个印第安人看来永远不会出现了\N{\rEng}[Bone sighs] This Indian is taking forever to show up.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:03.73,0:46:06.93,Default,,0,0,0,,讲讲你关于汽车旅馆的点子\N{\rEng}So, tell me about this motel trick of yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:07.37,0:46:08.67,Default,,0,0,0,,20块钱\N{\rEng}Twenty bucks.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:11.11,0:46:13.01,Default,,0,0,0,,不是个点子\N{\rEng}It's not a trick, all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:14.61,0:46:17.18,Default,,0,0,0,,它是一项无比的发明 足以让乔布斯自豪的发明\N{\rEng}It's a beautiful invention. It's an invention Steve Jobs would have been proud of.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:17.18,0:46:19.01,Default,,0,0,0,,- Steve Jobs -就是他\N{\rEng}- Steve Jobs, huh? - That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:19.01,0:46:22.12,Default,,0,0,0,,你知道什么造就了那个天才吗？ 简化\N{\rEng}You know what made that guy such a genius? Simplicity.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:22.12,0:46:23.89,Default,,0,0,0,,洗耳恭听\N{\rEng}- Let's hear it already. - All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:24.79,0:46:28.02,Default,,0,0,0,,我每年在汽车旅馆住100多天\N{\rEng}I stay in motels 100 nights a year, right.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:28.02,0:46:31.96,Default,,0,0,0,,每天早上我都会在门把手挂上“清理房间”的牌子\N{\rEng}First thing, every morning, I hang a "clean the room" sign on the doorknob.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:31.96,0:46:34.16,Default,,0,0,0,,服务员看到牌子就会打开门\N{\rEng}Maid sees the sign, she opens the door.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:34.16,0:46:36.83,Default,,0,0,0,,注意 细节来了\N{\rEng}Now, pay attention to the details here.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:36.83,0:46:38.77,Default,,0,0,0,,魔鬼就在细节里\N{\rEng}All the hard thought behind them.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:39.24,0:46:43.21,Default,,0,0,0,,我躺在床上 光溜溜的\N{\rEng}I'm lying on top of the covers, stone naked.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:44.21,0:46:47.48,Default,,0,0,0,,首先 我会看到服务员的眼睛 对吧？\N{\rEng}First crucial part, I look into the maid's eyes, all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:47.48,0:46:51.95,Default,,0,0,0,,否则她会立刻出去 故事还没有开始就结束了\N{\rEng}If I don't, she backs right outta that door. It's over before it even starts.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:52.82,0:46:56.25,Default,,0,0,0,,我拿出20块 放在我的鸡鸡上\N{\rEng}I take the twenty, I lay it right on my Jimmy.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:56.25,0:46:58.35,Default,,0,0,0,,- 就20块？\N{\rEng}- Boom. - Just a twenty?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:58.35,0:47:01.89,Default,,0,0,0,,服务员每小时工资八块三 过着贫苦的生活\N{\rEng}Maids make $8.35 an hour, and they've got miserable lives too.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:01.89,0:47:03.93,Default,,0,0,0,,那就是完全被低估的部分\N{\rEng}That's the totally underrated part of this.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:03.93,0:47:05.49,Default,,0,0,0,,完全取决于她\N{\rEng}The ball is completely in her court.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:05.50,0:47:07.53,Default,,0,0,0,,她可以立刻走出房间 对谁也没坏处\N{\rEng}She could back out of that door no harm, no foul.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:07.53,0:47:10.80,Default,,0,0,0,,或者……她可以过来拿钱\N{\rEng}Or... she could come and get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:12.97,0:47:16.07,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你的成功率是多少？ - 31%\N{\rEng}- What's your success rate? - [Bone] Thirty-one percent.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:16.07,0:47:18.31,Default,,0,0,0,,一年上百晚的汽车旅馆 你却用来做统计\N{\rEng}Hundred motels a year,you do the math.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:19.88,0:47:22.88,Default,,0,0,0,,他戴着和白牛一样的黄手套\N{\rEng}He's got the same little yellow gloves White Bull wears.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:22.88,0:47:25.05,Default,,0,0,0,,- 那是印第安人的习惯吗？ - 可能吧\N{\rEng}- Is that an Indian thing? - [Sly] I guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:30.96,0:47:33.12,Default,,0,0,0,,- 不错\N{\rEng}- It's good.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:33.92,0:47:36.33,Default,,0,0,0,,那是乔布斯级别的创意\N{\rEng}That's Steve fucking Jobs good.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:37.13,0:47:40.30,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我发现一个缺点 品控的问题\N{\rEng}- I see one flaw. Quality control.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:40.30,0:47:42.97,Default,,0,0,0,,我才付20块 不会奢望是个美国小姐的\N{\rEng}I'm paying her 20 bucks, I'm not asking for Miss America.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:43.50,0:47:48.47,Default,,0,0,0,,找遍全国也凑不齐31个值得上的女服务员啊\N{\rEng}Still, there's no way there's 31 maids in the whole country worth banging.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:48.47,0:47:50.44,Default,,0,0,0,,会出乎你的认知的\N{\rEng}You'd be surprised.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:56.45,0:47:58.25,Default,,0,0,0,,天啊\N{\rEng}Oh dear.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:00.92,0:48:03.19,Default,,0,0,0,,一晚上了 他一句有用的都没有\N{\rEng}Been at it all night,haven't gotten a thing out of him.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:05.96,0:48:07.16,Default,,0,0,0,,他不会说的\N{\rEng}And you won't.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:12.40,0:48:13.47,Default,,0,0,0,,你懂的 痛苦……\N{\rEng}You know, pain...
Dialogue: 0,0:48:16.90,0:48:19.14,Default,,0,0,0,,对这些家伙是家常便饭\N{\rEng}it's like a religion to these guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:19.14,0:48:22.07,Default,,0,0,0,,阿帕奇人认为承受折磨是一种荣耀\N{\rEng}You know, the Apaches used to consider getting tortured a mark of honor.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:22.07,0:48:23.54,Default,,0,0,0,,那怎么会形成一种价值体系的？\N{\rEng}How's that for a value system?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:23.54,0:48:24.84,Default,,0,0,0,,他是ute人\N{\rEng}He's a Ute.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:25.84,0:48:29.15,Default,,0,0,0,,- 那又怎么样？ - 本地印第安人是Utes人 不是阿帕奇人\N{\rEng}- What now?- Local Indians are Utes. Not Apache.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:29.15,0:48:32.02,Default,,0,0,0,,我娶了个印第安人 你觉得我不会知道他们的区别吗\N{\rEng}You know I married an Indian. Don't you think I know the difference?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:22.94,0:49:24.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Kehoe从来没有发生过的\N{\rEng}This doesn't happen in Kehoe.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:27.41,0:49:29.01,Default,,0,0,0,,现在有了\N{\rEng}It just did.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:56.24,0:49:58.01,Default,,0,0,0,,这是他的第一趟\N{\rEng}It was his first run.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:01.58,0:50:04.28,Default,,0,0,0,,他对我说：就一次 爸爸\N{\rEng}"Just one run, Papa," he says to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:07.38,0:50:08.62,Default,,0,0,0,,我能行的\N{\rEng}"I can do it."
Dialogue: 0,0:50:11.22,0:50:12.25,Default,,0,0,0,,我是你的儿子\N{\rEng}"I'm your son."
Dialogue: 0,0:50:12.49,0:50:14.02,Default,,0,0,0,,我们应该怎么办？\N{\rEng}What are we going to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:30.67,0:50:32.64,Default,,0,0,0,,我们回丹佛\N{\rEng}Okay, let's go home to Denver.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:08.71,0:51:10.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Coxman先生
Dialogue: 0,0:51:22.36,0:51:24.33,Default,,0,0,0,,深感同情\N{\rEng}I'm very sorry for your loss.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:27.73,0:51:28.97,Default,,0,0,0,,谢了\N{\rEng}Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:34.41,0:51:35.44,Default,,0,0,0,,嗨\N{\rEng}Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:36.47,0:51:37.51,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么样……\N{\rEng}So...
Dialogue: 0,0:51:38.24,0:51:39.64,Default,,0,0,0,,- 给你 - 谢谢\N{\rEng}-  Here you go. - Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:41.05,0:51:44.15,Default,,0,0,0,,我的前男友在丹佛工作 今天我给他打了电话\N{\rEng}Ex-boyfriend of mine works Vice in Denver. So I gave him a call today.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:44.15,0:51:47.28,Default,,0,0,0,,因为你想他了 想看看他怎么样了\N{\rEng}Because you missed him and wanted to see how he was doing.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:47.28,0:51:50.09,Default,,0,0,0,,他依然觉得我们还有可能\N{\rEng}Well, he still thinks there's a chance for us.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:50.09,0:51:51.12,Default,,0,0,0,,他叫什么？\N{\rEng}What's his name?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:52.59,0:51:53.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Kurt
Dialogue: 0,0:51:55.66,0:51:59.40,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你们谈了多久？ -2个月\N{\rEng}- How long were you two lovers? - Oh, Jesus. Two months, okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:01.07,0:52:04.70,Default,,0,0,0,,我让他调查了一下挂在路牌上的那个家伙\N{\rEng}I had him look up the forensics on our sign hanger.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:04.90,0:52:07.09,Default,,0,0,0,,那个叫做Simon LeGrew The guy's name is Simon LeGrew.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:07.67,0:52:10.11,Default,,0,0,0,,他的父亲是白牛\N{\rEng}Now, his father is White Bull.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:10.11,0:52:12.64,Default,,0,0,0,,他是一个丹佛的土著毒品贩子\N{\rEng}He's a Native American drug dealer from Denver
Dialogue: 0,0:52:12.64,0:52:15.45,Default,,0,0,0,,经营这里的毒品生意30多年了\N{\rEng}who's been dealing coke around here for 30 years.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:15.45,0:52:19.12,Default,,0,0,0,,白牛和维京人共享地盘\N{\rEng}So now, White Bull shares territory with Viking.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:19.12,0:52:23.09,Default,,0,0,0,,维京人也是丹佛的毒品贩子 名字叫做Trevor Calcote \N{\rEng}He's a Denver drug dealer whose real name is Trevor Calcote.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:23.46,0:52:24.49,Default,,0,0,0,,那么……\N{\rEng}So...
Dialogue: 0,0:52:25.09,0:52:26.56,Default,,0,0,0,,我寻思着……\N{\rEng}I'm thinking...
Dialogue: 0,0:52:26.56,0:52:28.69,Default,,0,0,0,,这里正在发生一场地盘争夺战\N{\rEng}what we have here is a turf war.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:29.63,0:52:31.23,Default,,0,0,0,,毒品地盘争夺战\N{\rEng}A drug turf war.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:32.16,0:52:33.57,Default,,0,0,0,,就在Kehoe \N{\rEng}Right here in Kehoe.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:35.84,0:52:37.60,Default,,0,0,0,,我们该怎么办？\N{\rEng}So what are we gonna do about it?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:42.41,0:52:48.11,Default,,0,0,0,,我30年的经验告诉那是丹佛警局的事情\N{\rEng}Well, my 30 years' experience tells me that this is a job for Denver Vice.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:48.11,0:52:52.55,Default,,0,0,0,,我对本地毒品的了解比你还多 不让你困扰吗？\N{\rEng}It doesn't bother you that I just learned more about a local drug lord
Dialogue: 0,0:52:52.55,0:52:55.59,Default,,0,0,0,,5分钟的电话比你30年知道的还多？\N{\rEng}in five minutes on the phone than you've learned in 30 years?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:55.59,0:53:01.13,Default,,0,0,0,,唯一困扰我的是今晚Kurt 会不会在床上求你复合\N{\rEng}What bothers me is that Kurt's lying in bed tonight convinced that he's back in your heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:06.53,0:53:08.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Kurt 就是个大男孩\N{\rEng}Kurt's a big boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:08.87,0:53:10.67,Default,,0,0,0,,我就知道你会回来的\N{\rEng}[Brock] I knew you'd be back.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:13.17,0:53:16.34,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧 维京人的真名叫做Trevor Calcote \N{\rEng}All right, Viking's real name is Trevor Calcote.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:16.34,0:53:18.84,Default,,0,0,0,,如果你想要他的命 你必须请个杀手\N{\rEng}If you want him dead, you're gonna have to hire a hit man.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:18.85,0:53:21.62,Default,,0,0,0,,- 杀手？ - 刺客\N{\rEng}- A hit man? - Yeah. An assassin.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:23.32,0:53:24.48,Default,,0,0,0,,你有认识的吗？\N{\rEng}Do you know one?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:25.29,0:53:26.59,Default,,0,0,0,,爱斯基摩人\N{\rEng}The Eskimo.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:29.42,0:53:31.26,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么操作？\N{\rEng}So, how does this work?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:31.56,0:53:35.53,Default,,0,0,0,,你帮爱斯基摩人买一张火车票 他恐飞机\N{\rEng}You buy The Eskimo a train ticket. He's afraid to fly.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:35.53,0:53:38.86,Default,,0,0,0,,在火车站接到他 然后带他去旅馆\N{\rEng}You pick him up at the train station, you drive him to a motel
Dialogue: 0,0:53:38.87,0:53:40.83,Default,,0,0,0,,先给他一半儿钱\N{\rEng}where you give him half the money upfront.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:40.84,0:53:42.37,Default,,0,0,0,,然后回家等着\N{\rEng}And then you go home.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:43.74,0:53:47.24,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我怎么知道他成功了？ - 看丹佛邮报\N{\rEng}- How do I know when it's done? - Keep checking The Denver Post.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:47.24,0:53:49.28,Default,,0,0,0,,他们没法防一个好杀手的\N{\rEng}They can't resist a good rub out.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:50.51,0:53:54.18,Default,,0,0,0,,这些外号都是怎么来的？\N{\rEng}What is it with all these nicknames? Speedo, Viking, Eskimo.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:55.42,0:53:57.92,Default,,0,0,0,,爱斯基摩人 都是些帮派的事儿\N{\rEng}The Eskimo.It's a gangster thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:57.92,0:53:59.19,Default,,0,0,0,,你有外号吗？\N{\rEng}Did you have a nickname?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:02.26,0:54:04.39,Default,,0,0,0,,有 翅膀侠\N{\rEng}Yeah. Wingman.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:05.69,0:54:06.76,Default,,0,0,0,,翅膀侠？\N{\rEng}Wingman?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:07.96,0:54:11.30,Default,,0,0,0,,出自《壮志凌云》那首歌 “你是我的翅膀侠”\N{\rEng}Yeah, from Top Gun. As in "you can be my Wingman."
Dialogue: 0,0:54:14.77,0:54:15.87,Default,,0,0,0,,翅膀侠\N{\rEng}Wingman.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:35.62,0:54:36.89,Default,,0,0,0,,快点\N{\rEng}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:41.50,0:54:42.73,Default,,0,0,0,,我尽力了 伙计\N{\rEng}I tried, buddy.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:19.34,0:55:21.84,Default,,0,0,0,,♪ Stand by your man
Dialogue: 0,0:55:23.67,0:55:27.85,Default,,0,0,0,,♪ Give him two arms To cling to ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:55:28.88,0:55:33.05,Default,,0,0,0,,♪ And something warm To come to ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:55:33.05,0:55:36.85,Default,,0,0,0,,♪ When nights are cold And lonely ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:55:37.96,0:55:39.86,Default,,0,0,0,,换首歌\N{\rEng}Some real music, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:42.03,0:55:45.00,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你想听什么歌？ -只要不是Kanye 都行\N{\rEng}- [driver] What do you want to hear? - Anything else. Just no Kanye.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:47.67,0:55:51.50,Default,,0,0,0,,♪ I'm a Barbie girl In a Barbie world ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:55:52.87,0:55:54.47,Default,,0,0,0,,扣他的小费\N{\rEng}Take it out of his tip.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:54.81,0:55:58.61,Default,,0,0,0,,♪ You can brush my hair Undress me everywhere ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:56:06.62,0:56:10.29,Default,,0,0,0,,镇上有个大型会议 只能订到这样的了\N{\rEng}There's a convention in town. This is all I could get.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:30.98,0:56:33.65,Default,,0,0,0,,- 那只有一半 - 是的\N{\rEng}- This is only half. - That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:35.98,0:56:37.28,Default,,0,0,0,,你是个警察吗？\N{\rEng}Are you a cop?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:37.82,0:56:38.75,Default,,0,0,0,,不是\N{\rEng}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:47.53,0:56:50.90,Default,,0,0,0,,我之所以这么问是因为\N{\rEng}The reason I ask is cops are always a year behind the street.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:50.90,0:56:55.00,Default,,0,0,0,,在道上早就是先付三分之二了\N{\rEng}But the street knows it's two-thirds upfront, one-third when the deal is done.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:55.50,0:56:58.74,Default,,0,0,0,,但是警察……还以为是先付一半\N{\rEng}But cops... they still think it's half and half.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:05.55,0:57:07.88,Default,,0,0,0,,好的 我们也可以先付三分之二\N{\rEng}Okay. We can do two-thirds.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:16.49,0:57:18.56,Default,,0,0,0,,就这样吧\N{\rEng}We're gonna get along  just fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:20.49,0:57:21.59,Default,,0,0,0,,好\N{\rEng}Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:57:21.60,0:57:24.76,Default,,0,0,0,,一万！\N{\rEng}Yes! Ten grand! Ten grand, baby!
Dialogue: 0,0:57:24.77,0:57:25.77,Default,,0,0,0,,一万块！\N{\rEng}Ten grand!
Dialogue: 0,0:57:27.27,0:57:31.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Jet达阵打败了Brown队 忠诚哪里去了？\N{\rEng}That Jet touchdown just beat your Browns. Whatever happened to loyalty?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:35.44,0:57:37.75,Default,,0,0,0,,有时候忠诚也是有代价的\N{\rEng}Sometimes loyalty comes at a price.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:39.11,0:57:41.55,Default,,0,0,0,,另外 我奶奶家就是布鲁克林的\N{\rEng}And besides, my grandmother's from Brooklyn.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:41.55,0:57:43.72,Default,,0,0,0,,为什么你不分给她一份呢？\N{\rEng}So? Why don't you give her a cut?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:49.76,0:57:50.66,Default,,0,0,0,,谁？\N{\rEng}Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:51.96,0:57:55.60,Default,,0,0,0,,他说他是The Eskimo 说有你需要的信息\N{\rEng}Says he's The Eskimo. Says he has information you wanna buy.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:56.53,0:57:57.60,Default,,0,0,0,,洗耳恭听\N{\rEng}Let's hear him out.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:03.81,0:58:06.77,Default,,0,0,0,,有人出9万元要你的命\N{\rEng}I've been offered ninety grand to ice you.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:06.77,0:58:08.04,Default,,0,0,0,,杀我？\N{\rEng}To ice me?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:09.04,0:58:12.58,Default,,0,0,0,,你想要刺杀一个人 你去找The Eskimo\N{\rEng}You wanna ice a guy, you go to The Eskimo. Well, that works for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:13.51,0:58:15.58,Default,,0,0,0,,谁知道白牛还会这一手？\N{\rEng}Who knew White Bull had that kind of coin?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:15.58,0:58:18.72,Default,,0,0,0,,白牛是印第安人 印第安人不在外面找杀手\N{\rEng}White Bull's an Indian. Indians don't farm out their kills.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:18.72,0:58:22.46,Default,,0,0,0,,- 如果不是白牛 那是谁？ - 那这是我要卖的信息\N{\rEng}- So, if it wasn't White Bull, then who the hell was it? - That's what I'm selling.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:22.46,0:58:25.46,Default,,0,0,0,,- 多少钱？ 9万\N{\rEng}- Well, how much? - Ninety grand.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:27.16,0:58:29.16,Default,,0,0,0,,你喜欢搞平衡啊\N{\rEng}You gotta love the symmetry, there.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:29.16,0:58:32.00,Default,,0,0,0,,你是个生意人\N{\rEng}You are one hell of a businessman.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:32.00,0:58:33.14,Default,,0,0,0,,我一直是\N{\rEng}I tries.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:34.87,0:58:37.57,Default,,0,0,0,,要用单数形式\N{\rEng}Try. It's a singular.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:39.51,0:58:42.01,Default,,0,0,0,,- 成交了吗？ - 当然 成交了\N{\rEng}- Do we have a deal? - 'Course we got a deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:44.92,0:58:47.75,Default,,0,0,0,,把钱存入这个开曼群岛的账号\N{\rEng}Deposit the money into this Cayman Islands account.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:47.75,0:58:50.22,Default,,0,0,0,,到帐后我会给你名字\N{\rEng}When it hits, you get the name.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:50.22,0:58:51.45,Default,,0,0,0,,好的\N{\rEng}Goody.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:02.07,0:59:04.20,Default,,0,0,0,,我喜欢与专业人士合作\N{\rEng}I like working with pros.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:04.20,0:59:06.24,Default,,0,0,0,,防止外行节外生枝\N{\rEng}Cuts way down on the bullshit factor.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:06.24,0:59:08.10,Default,,0,0,0,,是的 所以……\N{\rEng}Yeah. So...
Dialogue: 0,0:59:10.91,0:59:12.81,Default,,0,0,0,,谁想要我的命？\N{\rEng}who wants me dead?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:12.81,0:59:14.61,Default,,0,0,0,,他的名字是Coxman \N{\rEng}Guy's name is Coxman.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:15.61,0:59:16.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Coxman
Dialogue: 0,0:59:17.61,0:59:20.22,Default,,0,0,0,,老爹的工资单上有个叫做Coxman的吗？\N{\rEng}There was a Coxman on Dad's payroll, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:20.22,0:59:24.12,Default,,0,0,0,,他叫什么名字来着？他自称翅膀……翅根儿\N{\rEng}What was his name? He called himself, uh, Wing... Ding...
Dialogue: 0,0:59:24.62,0:59:26.19,Default,,0,0,0,,炸蚕蛹……翅膀……翅根儿\N{\rEng}Ringworm... Wing... Ding...
Dialogue: 0,0:59:26.19,0:59:28.02,Default,,0,0,0,,- 翅膀侠 -翅膀侠\N{\rEng}- Wingman. - Wingman!
Dialogue: 0,0:59:28.03,0:59:29.09,Default,,0,0,0,,翅膀侠\N{\rEng}Wingman!
Dialogue: 0,0:59:29.09,0:59:32.13,Default,,0,0,0,,翅膀侠想要我的命 为什么？\N{\rEng}Wingman wants me dead? Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:32.70,0:59:35.57,Default,,0,0,0,,什么原因不关我事 我没问\N{\rEng}The why of it ain't my business so I don't aks.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:37.84,0:59:40.30,Default,,0,0,0,,- 去问一下 - 我们的事已经结了\N{\rEng}- Ask. - I think our business here is done.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:40.31,0:59:41.97,Default,,0,0,0,,既然如此\N{\rEng}So it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:42.61,0:59:46.21,Default,,0,0,0,,我能问你两个问题吗？\N{\rEng}Hey, can I ask two questions? If I may.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:46.94,0:59:48.61,Default,,0,0,0,,专业人士对专业人士\N{\rEng}One pro to another.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:52.62,0:59:53.58,Default,,0,0,0,,当然\N{\rEng}Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:57.69,0:59:59.96,Default,,0,0,0,,他们为啥叫你爱斯基摩人？\N{\rEng}Why do they call you The Eskimo?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:00.56,1:00:02.93,Default,,0,0,0,,来自于《街头霸王》\N{\rEng}Comes from the brothers in the hood.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:02.93,1:00:06.93,Default,,0,0,0,,任何一个敢搬到冰天雪地的黑鬼肯定是爱斯基摩人\N{\rEng}Any nigga crazy enough to move up to snow country has gotta be a fucking Eskimo.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:10.34,1:00:12.30,Default,,0,0,0,,那……够幽默的\N{\rEng}That's... you're funny.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:12.30,1:00:15.54,Default,,0,0,0,,- 第二个问题 - 好吧\N{\rEng}- Second question. - All right, it's...
Dialogue: 0,1:00:17.88,1:00:20.11,Default,,0,0,0,,谁教的你品德思想？\N{\rEng}Who taught you your ethics?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:20.11,1:00:22.18,Default,,0,0,0,,你说什么？\N{\rEng}Come again?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:22.18,1:00:26.55,Default,,0,0,0,,你收了9万元答应杀我 但是你却不尊重交易\N{\rEng}You made a deal to kill me for 90 grand and you didn't honor that deal.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:27.65,1:00:30.16,Default,,0,0,0,,因为我会尊重这个交易\N{\rEng}It's because I'm honoring this one.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:33.26,1:00:34.26,Default,,0,0,0,,是的\N{\rEng}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:36.06,1:00:40.27,Default,,0,0,0,,对于一个道上说话不算话的人\N{\rEng}Guess a man's word doesn't matter in the hood, right?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:41.30,1:00:44.90,Default,,0,0,0,,对于一个只考虑自己的人\N{\rEng}Guess it's just every man for himself in there.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:44.90,1:00:47.94,Default,,0,0,0,,要知道 每人都有自己的角色\N{\rEng}You see, out here, character counts.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:47.94,1:00:50.94,Default,,0,0,0,,没有各自的角色 也就没有买卖\N{\rEng}Without character there can be no business and...
Dialogue: 0,1:00:51.21,1:00:53.11,Default,,0,0,0,,没有买卖的话……\N{\rEng}without business...
Dialogue: 0,1:00:54.15,1:00:55.18,Default,,0,0,0,,那么……\N{\rEng}well...
Dialogue: 0,1:00:57.05,1:00:59.09,Default,,0,0,0,,每天我们还能干什么？\N{\rEng}what the hell would we do all day?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:16.70,1:01:18.71,Default,,0,0,0,,你能从地毯上下来吗？\N{\rEng}Would you mind stepping off the rug?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:31.79,1:01:33.85,Default,,0,0,0,,这就是你说的爱斯基摩人卷吗？\N{\rEng}Is this what you call an Eskimo Roll?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:45.03,1:01:47.37,Default,,0,0,0,,我正在考虑爱尔兰\N{\rEng}I'm thinking Ireland.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:48.84,1:01:50.17,Default,,0,0,0,,德国也行\N{\rEng}Maybe Germany.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:51.04,1:01:52.31,Default,,0,0,0,,什么？\N{\rEng}Yeah? For what?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:53.71,1:01:56.31,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我的万元度假\N{\rEng}- My ten grand vacation. - Oh.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:57.85,1:02:01.02,Default,,0,0,0,,是啊 不管怎样 吉尼斯黑啤酒比贝克啤酒好\N{\rEng}Yeah, well, Guinness over Becks any day.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:07.39,1:02:09.09,Default,,0,0,0,,然后是都柏林\N{\rEng}Then Dublin it is.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:10.99,1:02:12.83,Default,,0,0,0,,你要带我去都柏林？\N{\rEng}You're gonna take me to Dublin?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:13.33,1:02:14.36,Default,,0,0,0,,是的\N{\rEng}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:17.37,1:02:18.40,Default,,0,0,0,,嗨\N{\rEng}Hey.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:24.31,1:02:26.34,Default,,0,0,0,,野马 如果我们被发现了\N{\rEng}Mustang, if we get caught out.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:28.04,1:03:29.04,Default,,0,0,0,,翅膀侠\N{\rEng}Wingman.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:29.81,1:03:31.04,Default,,0,0,0,,最近怎么样？\N{\rEng}How the hell you been?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:38.38,1:03:40.72,Default,,0,0,0,,我们想请你走一趟\N{\rEng}We'd like you to come for a little ride.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:01.07,1:04:04.78,Default,,0,0,0,,翅膀侠 和我聊聊爱斯基摩人的事\N{\rEng}Okay, Wingman, tell me about The Eskimo.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:05.04,1:04:08.04,Default,,0,0,0,,我猜你还没有搞清楚\N{\rEng}I guess you just don't get what you pay for anymore.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:08.05,1:04:10.25,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我们之中是有人还不清楚 - 是吗？\N{\rEng}- Some of us do. - Oh yeah?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:10.58,1:04:13.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Speedo Limbo Santa 都怎么了？\N{\rEng}Well, what about Speedo and Limbo and Santa?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:13.95,1:04:16.19,Default,,0,0,0,,这些为你做事的人都怎么了？\N{\rEng}How did those guys work out for you, huh?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:16.19,1:04:21.26,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧 在你死之前 你得告诉我到底怎么回事\N{\rEng}Okay. Now before you die, you're gonna tell me what this is all about.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:21.26,1:04:24.46,Default,,0,0,0,,唯一的问题是你能承受多少痛苦？\N{\rEng}The only question is, how much pain do you wanna endure?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:24.46,1:04:29.50,Default,,0,0,0,,我得了癌症 所以去你的吧\N{\rEng}I got cancer of the ass, dickweed. So screw you, and screw your pain.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:30.07,1:04:32.07,Default,,0,0,0,,你想要知道怎么回事？\N{\rEng}You wanna know what this is all about?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:32.94,1:04:35.04,Default,,0,0,0,,- 和Bullitt有关  - 我父亲？\N{\rEng}- It's about Bullitt. - My father?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:35.04,1:04:37.38,Default,,0,0,0,,靠说谎偷了我的女人\N{\rEng}Lying piece of shit stole my woman.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:37.38,1:04:39.44,Default,,0,0,0,,老爹看到有洞的就上\N{\rEng}Dad banged anything with a hole.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:39.45,1:04:42.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Bone  以前你都是怎么说他的？\N{\rEng}Hey Bone, what is it you used to say about him?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:42.15,1:04:44.42,Default,,0,0,0,,如果有人抓着响尾蛇的头 他也能上\N{\rEng}He'd bang a rattlesnake if someone held its head.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:44.42,1:04:46.42,Default,,0,0,0,,- 恕我直言 - 不 没事\N{\rEng}- No offense. - No, none taken.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:46.92,1:04:50.45,Default,,0,0,0,,- 老爹有很多女人 - 但是其中一个是我的\N{\rEng}- Dad had thousands of women. - Yeah, well, one of them was mine.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:50.46,1:04:55.23,Default,,0,0,0,,-和我有什么关系？ - 他酸腐的血液正在你的血管里流淌\N{\rEng}What's that got to do with me? - His rancid blood runs through your veins.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:55.23,1:05:00.33,Default,,0,0,0,,还有那堆满愚蠢笑容的傲慢脸皮\N{\rEng}And that stupid grin of his is plastered all over your arrogant face.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:03.34,1:05:04.94,Default,,0,0,0,,我的可卡因在哪里？\N{\rEng}Where's my cocaine?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:07.61,1:05:09.48,Default,,0,0,0,,我给冲到厕所里了\N{\rEng}I flushed it down the toilet.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:10.04,1:05:12.41,Default,,0,0,0,,- 那可是有10公斤啊 - 至少\N{\rEng}- That was ten kilos. - At least.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:13.05,1:05:15.31,Default,,0,0,0,,说实话 我以为会更多呢\N{\rEng}Honestly, I thought it was more.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:15.32,1:05:17.92,Default,,0,0,0,,所以 你杀了我的人\N{\rEng}So, you kill my men,
Dialogue: 0,1:05:19.12,1:05:22.89,Default,,0,0,0,,你偷了我的毒品 就为了个女人？\N{\rEng}you steal my coke,over a goddamn woman?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:23.49,1:05:27.46,Default,,0,0,0,,那叫做爱 宝贝 你应该体验一下\N{\rEng}It's called love, sweetheart. You should try it sometime.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:28.53,1:05:30.47,Default,,0,0,0,,我们说完了吗？\N{\rEng}Now, are we done?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:31.20,1:05:34.00,Default,,0,0,0,,还是你想接着聊？\N{\rEng}Or do you want to keep on chatting, skippy?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:38.01,1:05:39.44,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧 翅膀侠\N{\rEng}Okay, Wingman.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:41.48,1:05:43.68,Default,,0,0,0,,看 这就是你的所行\N{\rEng}See, that's how you do it, fellas.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:43.68,1:05:46.08,Default,,0,0,0,,这就是你所求\N{\rEng}That's how you go out strong.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:22.12,1:06:23.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Kehoe分局\N{\rEng}Kehoe Precinct.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:24.19,1:06:26.09,Default,,0,0,0,,-等会儿 Kim  - 在\N{\rEng}- Yeah, just a sec. Kim. - Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:26.09,1:06:27.99,Default,,0,0,0,,丹佛来的\N{\rEng}Denver Vice.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:30.63,1:06:32.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Kurt 嗨
Dialogue: 0,1:06:34.00,1:06:38.03,Default,,0,0,0,,你让我深挖维京人和白牛的料\N{\rEng}So, that deep dive into Viking and White Bull that you asked for...
Dialogue: 0,1:06:38.03,1:06:39.53,Default,,0,0,0,,我拿到了所有的文件\N{\rEng}I got all the files here.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:39.54,1:06:41.44,Default,,0,0,0,,你是最棒的\N{\rEng}You're the best.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:41.44,1:06:42.60,Default,,0,0,0,,好不容易啊\N{\rEng}Wasn't easy.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:42.61,1:06:45.07,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢你 能发邮件给我吗？\N{\rEng}Thank you. Can you email them over?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:45.31,1:06:49.21,Default,,0,0,0,,我可以 或者我可以开车亲自教给你\N{\rEng}I could. Or I could drive them up and put them right into your warm hands.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:49.21,1:06:53.11,Default,,0,0,0,,当然 是3个小时的车程 我需要个地方过夜\N{\rEng}'Course, it's a three-hour drive, so I need a place to stay the night.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:53.12,1:06:57.65,Default,,0,0,0,,我那有地方 不过有个问题\N{\rEng}Well, there's always my place. But, here's the thing.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:57.65,1:07:01.39,Default,,0,0,0,,我需要整晚的看那些文件\N{\rEng}I really need to spend all night with those files.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:02.39,1:07:04.73,Default,,0,0,0,,如果你能尽快发给我的话\N{\rEng}Now, if you were to shoot them right over to me,
Dialogue: 0,1:07:04.73,1:07:07.30,Default,,0,0,0,,我到晚上的时候就可能就看完了\N{\rEng}I could probably be done with them by tonight.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:07.30,1:07:12.14,Default,,0,0,0,,也许那个时候我能有空做别的事情了\N{\rEng}And then I could put all my pent up energy into something else.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:12.40,1:07:17.47,Default,,0,0,0,,-好的 给你了 宝贝\N{\rEng}- Hmm. Okay, well, you got them, baby. Bang.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:17.48,1:07:18.94,Default,,0,0,0,,就在你的收件箱里了\N{\rEng}Right in your inbox.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:19.44,1:07:20.64,Default,,0,0,0,,收到了\N{\rEng}Oh, they're right in there.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:20.65,1:07:23.38,Default,,0,0,0,,我们应该怎么处理这些呢？\N{\rEng}So, how do we wanna do this?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:23.38,1:07:26.38,Default,,0,0,0,,我想要你给我留着门 关着灯\N{\rEng}I'm thinking you leave the door open and your lights off.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:26.38,1:07:28.35,Default,,0,0,0,,相信我只要找到……\N{\rEng}Trust me to find...
Dialogue: 0,1:07:29.52,1:07:31.69,Default,,0,0,0,,稍等 怎么回事？\N{\rEng}Hold on a second. What was that?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:31.69,1:07:34.26,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我是说 - 啊 天呀 雪崩了\N{\rEng}- I said... - Oh God, we got an avalanche.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:34.26,1:07:35.69,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我再打给你\N{\rEng}- I gotta call you back.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:42.17,1:07:43.67,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么样  Gip
Dialogue: 0,1:07:44.80,1:07:45.70,Default,,0,0,0,,不错
Dialogue: 0,1:07:58.58,1:08:00.75,Default,,0,0,0,,对你来说我像个流浪汉吗？\N{\rEng}Do I look like a homeless guy to you?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:03.32,1:08:04.72,Default,,0,0,0,,30年前……\N{\rEng}Thirty years ago...
Dialogue: 0,1:08:06.26,1:08:10.23,Default,,0,0,0,,我住在那伙毒贩房子下面的地洞里\N{\rEng}I lived in a hole in the ground below the house of the guy that dealt me drugs.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:11.40,1:08:16.03,Default,,0,0,0,,一天 他们来找我 和我握手\N{\rEng}One day, he came to me,stuck out his hand.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:19.27,1:08:20.37,Default,,0,0,0,,我也伸手了\N{\rEng}I took it.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:22.27,1:08:23.64,Default,,0,0,0,,然后我们达成了交易\N{\rEng}And we made a deal.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:26.28,1:08:27.58,Default,,0,0,0,,那是笔好交易\N{\rEng}It was a good deal.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:29.82,1:08:31.22,Default,,0,0,0,,但不够好\N{\rEng}Not a great deal.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:33.82,1:08:36.46,Default,,0,0,0,,我应该像我哥哥一样买下一个赌场的\N{\rEng}I should have bought a casino like my brother.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:40.39,1:08:41.76,Default,,0,0,0,,但是交易就是交易\N{\rEng}But a deal is a deal.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:43.30,1:08:44.43,Default,,0,0,0,,我尊重它\N{\rEng}And I honored it.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:46.53,1:08:47.57,Default,,0,0,0,,那种荣耀\N{\rEng}That honor...
Dialogue: 0,1:08:48.67,1:08:50.54,Default,,0,0,0,,需要用屠杀来偿还\N{\rEng}was repaid with butchery.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:53.21,1:08:54.74,Default,,0,0,0,,他们杀了我唯一的儿子\N{\rEng}They took my only son.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:58.51,1:08:59.61,Default,,0,0,0,,今天……\N{\rEng}Today...
Dialogue: 0,1:09:01.38,1:09:04.08,Default,,0,0,0,,我的儿子走完了他的最后旅程\N{\rEng}my boy will make his final journey home.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:06.62,1:09:07.79,Default,,0,0,0,,我们会留下来\N{\rEng}We will stay.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:09.52,1:09:10.69,Default,,0,0,0,,复仇\N{\rEng}Take our revenge.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:12.49,1:09:14.80,Default,,0,0,0,,我要以血还血\N{\rEng}I will have blood for blood.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:17.43,1:09:18.80,Default,,0,0,0,,以子还子\N{\rEng}A son for a son.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:09.82,1:10:11.85,Default,,0,0,0,,- 妈的 - 你忘了\N{\rEng}- Goddamn it. - [Aya] You forgot.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:11.85,1:10:12.89,Default,,0,0,0,,什么？\N{\rEng}What?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:13.79,1:10:16.19,Default,,0,0,0,,- 什么？ - 欺负研讨会\N{\rEng}- What? - The bullying seminar.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:16.19,1:10:18.63,Default,,0,0,0,,呃 天\N{\rEng}Oh, God.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:18.63,1:10:20.53,Default,,0,0,0,,- 别的父母都到场了 -你对了 我忘了\N{\rEng}- Every other parent was there. - You're right, I forgot about the bullying seminar.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:20.90,1:10:22.76,Default,,0,0,0,,但是我允许你忘记 你知道为什么吗？\N{\rEng}But I'm allowed to forget, you know why?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:22.77,1:10:25.30,Default,,0,0,0,,因为我写了一张支票捐了一个电脑中心\N{\rEng}Because I wrote a check for a new computer center.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:25.30,1:10:29.21,Default,,0,0,0,,你给了支票 你就有权跳过150场家长会 这叫做数学\N{\rEng}You write a check, you get to skip on 150 bullying seminars. That's the math.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:29.77,1:10:32.21,Default,,0,0,0,,那是我生意的特权之一\N{\rEng}That's one of the perks of my business.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:32.61,1:10:35.51,Default,,0,0,0,,你根本不是商人 你是个罪犯\N{\rEng}You're not a businessman, Trevor. You're a criminal.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:37.65,1:10:41.22,Default,,0,0,0,,我的粉对你来说不够劲了吗？\N{\rEng}My powder's not good enough for you anymore? I remember when it was plenty good enough.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:41.22,1:10:42.89,Default,,0,0,0,,过去你是常常用的\N{\rEng}When you used to roll around in it.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:48.56,1:10:52.76,Default,,0,0,0,,我还记得只要一点我的粉\N{\rEng}See, I remember when just a little bit of my powder...
Dialogue: 0,1:10:55.60,1:10:58.30,Default,,0,0,0,,就能让你浪的象一匹野马\N{\rEng}made you buck like a bronco.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:00.40,1:11:01.47,Default,,0,0,0,,妈的\N{\rEng}Goddamn.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:03.57,1:11:06.84,Default,,0,0,0,,闭上你美丽的眼睛\N{\rEng}Close those beautiful brown eyes of yours.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:11.75,1:11:15.22,Default,,0,0,0,,否则看到眼里拔不出来了\N{\rEng}See if it all comes back to you.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:15.42,1:11:18.96,Default,,0,0,0,,他们下周办筹款活动 我帮你签了名\N{\rEng}They needed a host for next week's fundraiser. I signed you up.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:33.40,1:12:35.57,Default,,0,0,0,,给\N{\rEng}Here.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:35.57,1:12:37.47,Default,,0,0,0,,上周维京人的三个手下失踪了\N{\rEng}Three of Viking's drug dealers have disappeared in the last week.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:38.57,1:12:40.31,Default,,0,0,0,,谁是维京人来着？\N{\rEng}Tell me who Viking is again?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:41.47,1:12:44.38,Default,,0,0,0,,丹佛的毒品头子 白牛的对手\N{\rEng}The Denver drug lord. White Bull's rival.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:45.88,1:12:47.48,Default,,0,0,0,,让我问你一个问题\N{\rEng}Let me ask you a question.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:48.05,1:12:51.55,Default,,0,0,0,,什么让你以为我们能斗得过维京人或者白牛？\N{\rEng}What is it you think we might do to Viking or to White Bull?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:51.55,1:12:53.92,Default,,0,0,0,,拿下他们 拯救我们的城镇\N{\rEng}Take them out. Save our town.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:57.82,1:12:59.96,Default,,0,0,0,,我们有个问题要处理\N{\rEng}We got a little problem to solve.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:00.59,1:13:01.69,Default,,0,0,0,,我们……\N{\rEng}We...
Dialogue: 0,1:13:02.70,1:13:04.70,Default,,0,0,0,,我们把一个无辜的印第安人挂在路牌上\N{\rEng}we hung an innocent Indian from a road sign.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:04.70,1:13:06.93,Default,,0,0,0,,我估计白牛不会喜欢这一出的\N{\rEng}And my guess is White Bull's not gonna like that.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:07.40,1:13:11.64,Default,,0,0,0,,有人知道该怎么弥补这事吗？\N{\rEng}So, has anyone got any ideas on how we might set things right?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:11.64,1:13:14.01,Default,,0,0,0,,也许我们该道个歉\N{\rEng}Yeah, maybe we should apologize.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:14.64,1:13:16.61,Default,,0,0,0,,什么？\N{\rEng}Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:16.88,1:13:18.58,Default,,0,0,0,,一点小纰漏不应该让他们占上风\N{\rEng}One little screw up shouldn't make us their bitches.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:18.58,1:13:20.58,Default,,0,0,0,,我们可以给他们递个便条\N{\rEng}So we send them a short note.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:20.58,1:13:23.75,Default,,0,0,0,,便条上应该怎么说？\N{\rEng}Hey, and what does this, uh, short note say?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:23.75,1:13:28.09,Default,,0,0,0,,我不知道 “对不起 以后不会了”此类的\N{\rEng}I don't know. How about, "Sorry about Tonto, won't happen again"?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:30.76,1:13:32.63,Default,,0,0,0,,不\N{\rEng}No.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:34.26,1:13:37.36,Default,,0,0,0,,我觉得需要更真诚一些\N{\rEng}I'm thinking we need something with a bit more oomph. Something from our heart.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:54.85,1:13:57.75,Default,,0,0,0,,割下他的头 放在盒子里送过去\N{\rEng}Yeah, cut off his head. Stick it in a box and send it to them.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:57.75,1:13:59.72,Default,,0,0,0,,告诉他们他是罪魁祸首\N{\rEng}Tell them he's the culprit.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:59.72,1:14:03.69,Default,,0,0,0,,告诉他们我们以前的协议依然有效\N{\rEng}Tell them our old arrangement's back in effect and good to go.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:16.61,1:14:18.97,Default,,0,0,0,,把那个东西拿开\N{\rEng}Get that shit away from me, man.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:18.98,1:14:20.61,Default,,0,0,0,,你怎么了？\N{\rEng}What the hell's wrong with you?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:21.98,1:14:26.08,Default,,0,0,0,,我们有世界上最棒的大麻店 都是合法的\N{\rEng}We've got some of the best pot stores in the world, man. All legal.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:26.08,1:14:29.92,Default,,0,0,0,,但是你却选择抽保留地的烂大麻\N{\rEng}But no, instead you choose to smoke that dang reservation weed.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:31.05,1:14:32.66,Default,,0,0,0,,我更喜欢这个味儿\N{\rEng}Maybe I like it better.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:36.73,1:14:38.93,Default,,0,0,0,,- 白人\N{\rEng}- White people, man. - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:41.60,1:14:44.17,Default,,0,0,0,,我家的老鼠都比那个东西大\N{\rEng}You know I had a rat that was bigger than that thing.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:49.01,1:14:51.91,Default,,0,0,0,,你干脆吸那坨算了\N{\rEng}You should try smoking that shit instead.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:52.54,1:14:53.64,Default,,0,0,0,,太恶心了\N{\rEng}That's gross.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:57.58,1:14:58.75,Default,,0,0,0,,妈妈\N{\rEng}Mom!
Dialogue: 0,1:15:01.02,1:15:05.19,Default,,0,0,0,,这周她接 下周爸爸接\N{\rEng}She gets him this week, father gets him next week.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:07.82,1:15:10.13,Default,,0,0,0,,你能忍受和别人分享儿子吗？\N{\rEng}Can you imagine sharing your own son?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:11.66,1:15:12.70,Default,,0,0,0,,妈的\N{\rEng}Damn.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:15.63,1:15:17.73,Default,,0,0,0,,-  Kehoe.- 我是Kurt. \N{\rEng}-  Kehoe.- Hey, it's Kurt.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:19.07,1:15:21.14,Default,,0,0,0,,嗨\N{\rEng}Hi, Kurt.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:21.14,1:15:23.14,Default,,0,0,0,,你不配得到这些情报的\N{\rEng}You don't deserve this intel.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:25.08,1:15:27.98,Default,,0,0,0,,- 情报？ - 先告诉你不配\N{\rEng}- Intel? - First tell me you don't deserve it.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:28.68,1:15:30.55,Default,,0,0,0,,我不配 你拿到了什么？\N{\rEng}I don't deserve it. What you got?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:32.22,1:15:35.79,Default,,0,0,0,,一具尸体 Dante Ferstel  在丹佛峡谷发现的\N{\rEng}A body. Dante Ferstel. Kehoe kid. Found dead in a Denver alley.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:35.79,1:15:38.05,Default,,0,0,0,,吸毒过量 没什么稀奇的 对吧？\N{\rEng}Smack overdose. So, what's new, right?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:38.06,1:15:40.59,Default,,0,0,0,,不过是周六晚上嗨过了头而已\N{\rEng}Just another Saturday night sleeper.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:40.59,1:15:44.03,Default,,0,0,0,,窍门在于 Dante 是机场的行李员\N{\rEng}And here's the kicker. Dante was a baggage monkey at the airport.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:45.56,1:15:47.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Kehoe 机场？\N{\rEng}The Kehoe airport?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:56.31,1:15:57.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Coxman先生
Dialogue: 0,1:15:58.74,1:16:00.25,Default,,0,0,0,,什么事？\N{\rEng}What can I do for you?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:02.68,1:16:03.72,Default,,0,0,0,,是关于你儿子的事情\N{\rEng}It's about your son.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:10.12,1:16:12.26,Default,,0,0,0,,- 不知道你是否听说过Dante  Ferstel\N{\rEng} - I didn't know if you'd heard about Dante Ferstel.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:12.26,1:16:14.60,Default,,0,0,0,,死于吸毒过量\N{\rEng}- Yeah. He died of an overdose.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:17.96,1:16:21.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Dante 和你儿子一样都在机场工作\N{\rEng}Dante worked with your son at the airport, right?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:23.94,1:16:25.87,Default,,0,0,0,,- 是的 - 你认识他吗？\N{\rEng}- Yeah. - Did you know him?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:26.77,1:16:27.74,Default,,0,0,0,,不认识\N{\rEng}No.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:27.97,1:16:29.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Kyle 从没有提过他？\N{\rEng}Kyle never mention him to you?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:30.84,1:16:32.01,Default,,0,0,0,,没有\N{\rEng}No.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:38.99,1:16:40.12,Default,,0,0,0,,就这个？\N{\rEng}Is that it?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:41.32,1:16:42.92,Default,,0,0,0,,是的\N{\rEng}I guess it is.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:48.80,1:16:51.20,Default,,0,0,0,,我不明白你为什么到这里来\N{\rEng}I don't understand why you're here.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:51.93,1:16:53.03,Default,,0,0,0,,真相？\N{\rEng}Truth?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:54.23,1:16:56.10,Default,,0,0,0,,我认为你的儿子不是毒虫\N{\rEng}I don't think your son was a junkie.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:59.17,1:17:01.94,Default,,0,0,0,,我也不认为Dante Ferstel是毒虫\N{\rEng}And I don't think Dante Ferstel was either.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:03.38,1:17:05.95,Default,,0,0,0,,那么你认为他们怎么回事？\N{\rEng}So, what do you think happened to them?
Dialogue: 0,1:17:06.65,1:17:07.75,Default,,0,0,0,,我不知道\N{\rEng}I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:09.15,1:17:12.79,Default,,0,0,0,,我希望你能告诉我一些有用的信息\N{\rEng}I was hoping you might be able to tell me something that could help.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:17.12,1:17:18.13,Default,,0,0,0,,对不起……\N{\rEng}Sorry...
Dialogue: 0,1:17:19.66,1:17:20.93,Default,,0,0,0,,帮不了你\N{\rEng}I can't help you.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:21.63,1:17:24.77,Default,,0,0,0,,你也帮不了我 我还得干活\N{\rEng}You can't help me. I got work to do.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:27.74,1:17:28.90,Default,,0,0,0,,我明白\N{\rEng}I understand.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:30.24,1:17:31.34,Default,,0,0,0,,胶带\N{\rEng}Tape.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:32.24,1:17:33.28,Default,,0,0,0,,电击枪\N{\rEng}Taser.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:34.08,1:17:35.31,Default,,0,0,0,,抗生素\N{\rEng}Antibiotics.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:35.98,1:17:37.21,Default,,0,0,0,,抗生素？\N{\rEng}Antibiotics?
Dialogue: 0,1:17:37.81,1:17:39.71,Default,,0,0,0,,你被孩子咬过吗？\N{\rEng}Yeah, you ever been bitten by a kid?
Dialogue: 0,1:17:41.65,1:17:45.09,Default,,0,0,0,,熊孩子很脏的 宁可被狗咬\N{\rEng}Little bastards are nasty. You almost wish you were bitten by a dog.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:49.09,1:17:50.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes?
Dialogue: 0,1:17:52.36,1:17:53.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:57.30,1:17:58.80,Default,,0,0,0,,我们还不能抓他\N{\rEng}We can't grab him yet.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:59.23,1:18:02.80,Default,,0,0,0,,- 为什么不？ - 他们发了信息\N{\rEng}- Why not？ - They're sending a messenger.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:12.25,1:18:14.02,Default,,0,0,0,,我是信使\N{\rEng}I am the messenger.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:25.83,1:18:27.80,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢你能见我\N{\rEng}Thank you for seeing me.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:34.74,1:18:39.04,Default,,0,0,0,,他已经受到惩罚了 我们想要重归和平\N{\rEng}He's been punished for his deed. We want peace with you again.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:39.48,1:18:40.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:43.05,1:18:44.95,Default,,0,0,0,,我很欣赏这个礼物\N{\rEng}I appreciate the gift.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:46.05,1:18:47.65,Default,,0,0,0,,很有思想性\N{\rEng}It was thoughtful.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:54.12,1:18:56.96,Default,,0,0,0,,你一人前来也很有勇气\N{\rEng}You showed a lot of guts coming here alone.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:01.90,1:19:04.17,Default,,0,0,0,,但是我需要以子还子\N{\rEng}But I need a son for a son.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:41.01,1:19:43.11,Default,,0,0,0,,小心点 你会打到孩子的\N{\rEng}Careful, man! You might hit a kid.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:48.78,1:19:50.51,Default,,0,0,0,,你要再做 我会杀了你\N{\rEng}If you do it again,I'll kill you.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:50.52,1:19:51.85,Default,,0,0,0,,- Yes?
Dialogue: 0,1:19:52.78,1:19:54.99,Default,,0,0,0,,嗨 Ryan \N{\rEng}Hey, Ryan.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:55.39,1:19:57.96,Default,,0,0,0,,今天我接你回家\N{\rEng}Um, I'm taking you home today.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:59.09,1:20:01.46,Default,,0,0,0,,这周是我妈妈来接我\N{\rEng}But this is my mom's week to pick me up.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:01.46,1:20:05.13,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道 她在看牙过不来 让我过来接你\N{\rEng}Yeah, I know, but she got stuck at the dentist. Asked me to come and get you.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:05.56,1:20:06.73,Default,,0,0,0,,什么？\N{\rEng}What?
Dialogue: 0,1:20:07.80,1:20:08.87,Default,,0,0,0,,我们接他\N{\rEng}We take him.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:09.94,1:20:12.84,Default,,0,0,0,,- 信使怎么样了？ - 被干掉了\N{\rEng}- What about the messenger? - We shot the messenger.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:12.84,1:20:15.54,Default,,0,0,0,,我不记得她要去看牙啊\N{\rEng}I don't remember her telling me about a trip to the dentist.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:15.54,1:20:19.25,Default,,0,0,0,,她的牙根管有问题\N{\rEng}Yeah, she had a root canal develop some problems.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:20.85,1:20:24.75,Default,,0,0,0,,你爸爸让我来接你 我就来了\N{\rEng}And your dad said could I pick you up. So, here I am.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:25.18,1:20:28.32,Default,,0,0,0,,- 这里 - Tesla 呢？\N{\rEng}- This is us here. - What happened to the Tesla?
Dialogue: 0,1:20:33.23,1:20:34.16,Default,,0,0,0,,妈的\N{\rEng}Shit!
Dialogue: 0,1:21:03.99,1:21:05.52,Default,,0,0,0,,安全带\N{\rEng}Seatbelt.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:05.53,1:21:07.99,Default,,0,0,0,,- 孩子呢？-被带上了一个货车\N{\rEng}-  Where's the kid? - He got away in a van.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:08.93,1:21:10.26,Default,,0,0,0,,什么货车？\N{\rEng}What kind of a van?
Dialogue: 0,1:21:11.20,1:21:12.53,Default,,0,0,0,,上面有"Kehoe "字样\N{\rEng}Said "Kehoe" on it.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:13.87,1:21:16.90,Default,,0,0,0,,我们会找到孩子 找到货车 不会太久的\N{\rEng}We'll find the kid. We'll find the van. It won't take us long.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:16.90,1:21:20.01,Default,,0,0,0,,在他们发臭之前处理掉\N{\rEng}Get rid of these two before they start to stink.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:32.62,1:21:34.29,Default,,0,0,0,,接电话\N{\rEng}Answer the phone.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:42.93,1:21:43.96,Default,,0,0,0,,喂？\N{\rEng}Hello?
Dialogue: 0,1:21:46.67,1:21:49.57,Default,,0,0,0,,不行 他现在没法说话\N{\rEng}No, he can't talk right now.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:51.61,1:21:53.01,Default,,0,0,0,,因为他死了\N{\rEng}Because he's dead.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:55.58,1:21:58.21,Default,,0,0,0,,我们走 三辆车\N{\rEng}Let's go. Three cars.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:58.21,1:21:59.61,Default,,0,0,0,,尸体怎么办？\N{\rEng}What about the body?
Dialogue: 0,1:22:03.52,1:22:05.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Minya 处理一下\N{\rEng}Minya, take care of this.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:06.52,1:22:09.59,Default,,0,0,0,,我忙着呢 让那个印度人干\N{\rEng}I'm busy. Let the fucking Indian do it.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:23.11,1:22:25.38,Default,,0,0,0,,你不是我爸爸的手下 对吧？\N{\rEng}You don't work for my father, do you?
Dialogue: 0,1:22:30.25,1:22:32.35,Default,,0,0,0,,那些人到底是谁？\N{\rEng}Who were those guys anyways?
Dialogue: 0,1:22:32.72,1:22:34.18,Default,,0,0,0,,我不知道\N{\rEng}I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:37.55,1:22:39.36,Default,,0,0,0,,你不用担心他们\N{\rEng}You don't have to worry about them.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:40.22,1:22:41.12,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\rEng}Right.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:45.46,1:22:47.60,Default,,0,0,0,,他们不能带走我儿子还不打电话\N{\rEng}They can't take my son and not call.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:48.57,1:22:50.33,Default,,0,0,0,,不该这么办事的\N{\rEng}That's not how it's done.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:52.50,1:22:54.54,Default,,0,0,0,,那些混蛋\N{\rEng}Those tepee asswipes.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:56.37,1:22:58.01,Default,,0,0,0,,那些混蛋\N{\rEng}Those goddamn alkies.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:00.38,1:23:04.68,Default,,0,0,0,,我要抓住他们 一个个吊到路牌上\N{\rEng}I'm gonna take one of them, I'm gonna hang them from every road sign from here to Utah.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:05.68,1:23:09.09,Default,,0,0,0,,你抓了人家的儿子 都得打电话！这是常识！\N{\rEng}You take a man's son, you call! Everybody knows that!
Dialogue: 0,1:23:13.09,1:23:14.66,Default,,0,0,0,,他们抓走了我的儿子\N{\rEng}I mean, they took my boy.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:15.66,1:23:17.59,Default,,0,0,0,,我的儿子\N{\rEng}My little boy.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:17.59,1:23:20.10,Default,,0,0,0,,你疯了吗？这周是我接\N{\rEng}Are you insane! This is my week.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:20.10,1:23:25.37,Default,,0,0,0,,你不说一声就接他？你蠢到绑架自己的儿子？\N{\rEng}You pick him up without asking? Are you so damn stupid you'd kidnap your own son?
Dialogue: 0,1:23:25.37,1:23:30.01,Default,,0,0,0,,我等不及看律师信起草的协议了 完全监护权\N{\rEng}I can't wait to watch my lawyer write up the new arrangement. Full custody.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:31.34,1:23:35.01,Default,,0,0,0,,走运的话你每个月能见他两个小时\N{\rEng}You'll be lucky to get him two hours a month. Two supervised hours.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:35.01,1:23:37.01,Default,,0,0,0,,警察在场全程监护\N{\rEng}A cop in the room with you, watching you play.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:37.01,1:23:39.38,Default,,0,0,0,,直到他高中毕业\N{\rEng}You won't get him alone until he graduates from high school.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:39.38,1:23:43.19,Default,,0,0,0,,公立高中！和普通孩子！没有傻货食谱\N{\rEng}A public high school! With normal kids. And no stupid diets!
Dialogue: 0,1:23:47.19,1:23:50.46,Default,,0,0,0,,我想你不会再那么做了\N{\rEng}- I guess you won't be doing that again.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:51.23,1:23:54.00,Default,,0,0,0,,对吗？\N{\rEng}Right? Uh-huh.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:57.80,1:23:59.34,Default,,0,0,0,,他不在这里\N{\rEng}He's not here.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:01.11,1:24:03.04,Default,,0,0,0,,什么？\N{\rEng}- What? - Ah...
Dialogue: 0,1:24:04.64,1:24:07.74,Default,,0,0,0,,♪ Oh, let's fly Baby, let's fly away ♪
Dialogue: 0,1:24:07.75,1:24:11.12,Default,,0,0,0,,♪ Across tropical seas
Dialogue: 0,1:24:11.55,1:24:14.99,Default,,0,0,0,,♪ We'll have fun Underneath the sun ♪
Dialogue: 0,1:24:15.19,1:24:18.49,Default,,0,0,0,,♪ So, come on, baby, please
Dialogue: 0,1:24:19.09,1:24:20.53,Default,,0,0,0,,关掉音乐\N{\rEng}Turn that song off.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:27.07,1:24:30.30,Default,,0,0,0,,短信 另外一个号码\N{\rEng}It's a text. From a different number.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:31.67,1:24:35.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Sequoia旅馆 12号房\N{\rEng}"Sequoia Motel. Room twelve."
Dialogue: 0,1:24:35.71,1:24:37.71,Default,,0,0,0,,乔布斯 宝贝\N{\rEng}"Steve Jobs, baby."
Dialogue: 0,1:24:55.33,1:24:56.36,Default,,0,0,0,,嗨\N{\rEng}Hello.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:02.14,1:25:04.04,Default,,0,0,0,,小帐篷\N{\rEng}A little peepee tepee.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:36.17,1:25:37.67,Default,,0,0,0,,呃 妈的\N{\rEng}Oh, shit.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:49.59,1:25:54.15,Default,,0,0,0,,我了解这个世界 他们打电话来提要求 我满足要求\N{\rEng}I know how this world works. They call with their demands. I give them what they want.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:54.16,1:25:55.39,Default,,0,0,0,,然后Ryan就回来了\N{\rEng}We get Ryan back.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:57.83,1:26:01.70,Default,,0,0,0,,24个小时 否则我报警\N{\rEng}In 24 hours, I call the police.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:01.70,1:26:04.20,Default,,0,0,0,,24个小时 他一定回家\N{\rEng}In 24 hours, he'll be home.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:04.60,1:26:06.80,Default,,0,0,0,,你会下地狱过油锅的\N{\rEng}- You'll burn in hell for this.- Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:07.40,1:26:08.67,Default,,0,0,0,,回见\N{\rEng}I'll see you there.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:58.25,1:27:00.56,Default,,0,0,0,,欢迎光临\N{\rEng}- Welcome to Kehoe Chateau Montclair.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:00.56,1:27:04.49,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我们需要一个房间 -对不起 你需要预约（和保留地）\N{\rEng}- We need rooms tonight. - I'm sorry, you need a reservation.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:04.50,1:27:05.63,Default,,0,0,0,,什么？\N{\rEng}Excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:06.40,1:27:07.60,Default,,0,0,0,,预约（保留地）\N{\rEng}A reservation.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:08.87,1:27:09.93,Default,,0,0,0,,真的吗？\N{\rEng}Really?
Dialogue: 0,1:27:11.97,1:27:16.61,Default,,0,0,0,,预……呃 不  我不是那个意思\N{\rEng}A reser... Oh! No, I didn't mean it like that.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:16.61,1:27:19.74,Default,,0,0,0,,我的意思是来之前需要先登记\N{\rEng}I meant you need to reserve... book before you get here
Dialogue: 0,1:27:19.74,1:27:21.91,Default,,0,0,0,,因为我们客满了 就是这个意思\N{\rEng}because we're all full. That's all I meant.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:21.91,1:27:24.35,Default,,0,0,0,,你知道我听到什么了？\N{\rEng}You know what I heard?
Dialogue: 0,1:27:24.35,1:27:27.95,Default,,0,0,0,,你告诉我和我的朋友要回保留地\N{\rEng}You told me and my friends that we need to go back to the reservation.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:27.95,1:27:29.25,Default,,0,0,0,,呃 不\N{\rEng}Oh, no.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:30.25,1:27:35.36,Default,,0,0,0,,你知道我在Yelp能对你做什么吗？\N{\rEng}Do you have any idea what I can do to you on Yelp?
Dialogue: 0,1:27:37.76,1:27:40.26,Default,,0,0,0,,你希望我喊出你的老板来吗？\N{\rEng}You might wanna get your boss out here.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:40.26,1:27:42.83,Default,,0,0,0,,或者你再仔细看一下\N{\rEng}Or you could take another look.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:44.57,1:27:46.44,Default,,0,0,0,,我会再仔细看一下\N{\rEng}I will take another look.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:59.28,1:28:01.32,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你饿了吗？ - 当然\N{\rEng}- You hungry? - Sure.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:05.93,1:28:07.02,Default,,0,0,0,,鸡蛋？\N{\rEng}Eggs?
Dialogue: 0,1:28:07.03,1:28:08.26,Default,,0,0,0,,好的\N{\rEng}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:15.37,1:28:17.60,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你住在这里？ - 是的\N{\rEng}- You live here? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:21.41,1:28:22.48,Default,,0,0,0,,自己？\N{\rEng}All alone?
Dialogue: 0,1:28:23.94,1:28:24.91,Default,,0,0,0,,是的\N{\rEng}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:27.45,1:28:28.75,Default,,0,0,0,,你没有孩子吗？\N{\rEng}You don't have any kids?
Dialogue: 0,1:28:31.32,1:28:32.35,Default,,0,0,0,,不\N{\rEng}No.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:50.70,1:28:51.77,Default,,0,0,0,,你喜欢摇滚？\N{\rEng}You like rock?
Dialogue: 0,1:28:52.87,1:28:54.41,Default,,0,0,0,,我喜欢古典乐\N{\rEng}I like classical.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:12.39,1:29:15.83,Default,,0,0,0,,把我带回家并不明智\N{\rEng}It wasn't very smart bringing me to your house.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:17.83,1:29:18.87,Default,,0,0,0,,为什么？\N{\rEng}Why?
Dialogue: 0,1:29:24.47,1:29:25.94,Default,,0,0,0,,我想要和你爸爸谈谈\N{\rEng}I want to talk to your dad.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:26.87,1:29:27.91,Default,,0,0,0,,今晚？\N{\rEng}Tonight?
Dialogue: 0,1:29:28.78,1:29:29.94,Default,,0,0,0,,到早上\N{\rEng}In the morning.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:39.12,1:29:41.99,Default,,0,0,0,,油放多了\N{\rEng}They're a bit greasy.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:51.97,1:29:54.60,Default,,0,0,0,,你说过你没有孩子\N{\rEng}You said you didn't have any kids.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:54.97,1:29:56.71,Default,,0,0,0,,他走了\N{\rEng}He went away.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:57.47,1:29:58.84,Default,,0,0,0,,上床吧\N{\rEng}Go on, get in bed.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:03.78,1:30:05.55,Default,,0,0,0,,你睡哪里？\N{\rEng}Where are you gonna sleep?
Dialogue: 0,1:30:05.98,1:30:08.65,Default,,0,0,0,,我的房间 就在大厅\N{\rEng}In my room, down the hall.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:08.65,1:30:11.95,Default,,0,0,0,,- 如果我跑了呢？ -你没地儿能去 孩子\N{\rEng}- What if I run away? - There's nowhere for you to go, kid.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:11.95,1:30:14.59,Default,,0,0,0,,在外面你会冻死的 晚安\N{\rEng}You'd freeze to death out there. Goodnight.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:14.59,1:30:17.09,Default,,0,0,0,,我习惯上需要听睡前故事\N{\rEng}I always get read a story before bed.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:17.09,1:30:21.87,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我不会讲故事 -你可以随便读点什么 我都能听\N{\rEng}- I don't know any stories. - You can read me anything. I don't care what it is.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:25.70,1:30:29.67,Default,,0,0,0,,C-130是新款清雪车\N{\rEng}The new C-130 is the crème de la crme of snow-pushers.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:29.91,1:30:33.91,Default,,0,0,0,,环境友好型设计 额定载重三吨\N{\rEng}Built to humble Mother Nature, she has a rated load of three tons.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:33.91,1:30:39.15,Default,,0,0,0,,悬挂式UTV附件 通用型吹雪机\N{\rEng}The Overhausen UTV attachment snow blowers are made for universal use,
Dialogue: 0,1:30:39.15,1:30:41.98,Default,,0,0,0,,装备强劲现代引擎\N{\rEng}equipped with powerful modern engines.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:41.99,1:30:44.75,Default,,0,0,0,,它们极度高效和可适应性\N{\rEng}They're extremely effective and flexible.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:45.02,1:30:48.73,Default,,0,0,0,,每小时处理4000吨积雪\N{\rEng}A capacity of four thousand tons of snow per hour.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:49.76,1:30:52.03,Default,,0,0,0,,吹雪距离超过100英尺\N{\rEng}Throwing distance of a hundred feet.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:53.90,1:30:54.80,Default,,0,0,0,,是的\N{\rEng}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:56.03,1:30:58.50,Default,,0,0,0,,她是一台很棒的机器 好了\N{\rEng}She is a great machine,all right.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:58.84,1:31:00.14,Default,,0,0,0,,我有一台这样的\N{\rEng}I've got one of these.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:01.50,1:31:03.47,Default,,0,0,0,,我还以为你是个绑架犯呢\N{\rEng}I thought you were a kidnapper.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:05.48,1:31:06.71,Default,,0,0,0,,不是全职的\N{\rEng}Not all the time.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:08.51,1:31:11.12,Default,,0,0,0,,我能坐那个车吗？\N{\rEng}Well, can I get a ride in it?
Dialogue: 0,1:31:13.85,1:31:15.49,Default,,0,0,0,,你得睡觉了\N{\rEng}You are going to sleep.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:31.27,1:31:34.81,Default,,0,0,0,,你知道斯德哥尔摩综合症吗？（人质爱上绑匪的一种心理疾病）\N{\rEng}Have you heard of the Stockholm Syndrome?
Dialogue: 0,1:32:22.99,1:32:24.49,Default,,0,0,0,,早 老板\N{\rEng}[Thorpe] Morning, boss.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:25.16,1:32:26.26,Default,,0,0,0,,你找到他了吗？\N{\rEng}Did you find him?
Dialogue: 0,1:32:27.26,1:32:30.03,Default,,0,0,0,,还没有 我们会找到的\N{\rEng}Not yet. We will.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:30.03,1:32:32.23,Default,,0,0,0,,白牛先生\N{\rEng}Mr. White Bull.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:32.23,1:32:35.77,Default,,0,0,0,,这是一些免费的滑雪通行证 整个周末都可用 \N{\rEng}These are some complimentary ski passes. Good for the whole weekend.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:35.77,1:32:38.34,Default,,0,0,0,,给你和你的……朋友\N{\rEng}For you and all of your... friends.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:38.34,1:32:41.91,Default,,0,0,0,,再次感谢您能光临入住\N{\rEng}And I just wanna thank you again for choosing to stay with us.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:41.91,1:32:45.08,Default,,0,0,0,,我们知道你有别的娱乐安排\N{\rEng}We know that you do have other entertainment options.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:47.18,1:32:48.15,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\rEng}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:49.88,1:32:52.82,Default,,0,0,0,,- Ryan学校的Janitor -Janitor 为什么不呢？\N{\rEng}Janitor from Ryan's school. - Janitor, why not?
Dialogue: 0,1:32:53.22,1:32:56.52,Default,,0,0,0,,很荣幸能来这里 你一定听说了\N{\rEng}It's an honor to be here. You hear the whispers but...
Dialogue: 0,1:32:57.89,1:33:00.13,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你有什么能帮到我的吗？ - 或许\N{\rEng}- You have something for me? - I might.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:01.93,1:33:04.90,Default,,0,0,0,,你儿子上的货车 我之前见过\N{\rEng}The van your boy got into. I've seen it before.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:05.90,1:33:08.17,Default,,0,0,0,,开车的人我也见过\N{\rEng}And the guy that was driving that van, I've seen him too.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:08.67,1:33:12.27,Default,,0,0,0,,我和我的家人去Kehoe的度假胜地\N{\rEng}Me and my family go up to the resort in Kehoe.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:12.27,1:33:15.08,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你知道 最出名的那家 Chateau Montclair \N{\rEng}- You know, the fancy one? Chateau Montclair.- Oh, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:15.31,1:33:19.15,Default,,0,0,0,,我们一直看 突然打滑了\N{\rEng}Well, we're driving up and, you know, she scoots over and she's...
Dialogue: 0,1:33:19.15,1:33:23.25,Default,,0,0,0,,幸好是上坡路 你知道我的车漂移了\N{\rEng}showing a little appreciation on the way up, you get my drift?
Dialogue: 0,1:33:23.92,1:33:25.29,Default,,0,0,0,,我了解\N{\rEng}- I do. - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:25.69,1:33:27.95,Default,,0,0,0,,你曾经试着让车轮转正……\N{\rEng}You ever tried to keep the wheel straight when someone's...
Dialogue: 0,1:33:27.96,1:33:28.96,Default,,0,0,0,,货车\N{\rEng}The van.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:33.53,1:33:36.90,Default,,0,0,0,,正如我所说 那辆货车停下来帮了我\N{\rEng}Well, like I was saying. The van that stopped to help me...
Dialogue: 0,1:33:38.67,1:33:40.77,Default,,0,0,0,,就是那辆你孩子上的车\N{\rEng}that's the same van that your boy got into.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:41.40,1:33:44.07,Default,,0,0,0,,那个在夜晚把我从坑里拉出来的人\N{\rEng}And the guy who pulled me out of the ditch that night...
Dialogue: 0,1:33:45.11,1:33:47.08,Default,,0,0,0,,就是带走你的孩子的人\N{\rEng}he's the same guy that picked up your boy.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:47.38,1:33:49.91,Default,,0,0,0,,他的名字你过耳不忘\N{\rEng}He's got one of those names that you never ever forget.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:51.05,1:33:52.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Coxman
Dialogue: 0,1:33:53.88,1:33:54.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Coxman
Dialogue: 0,1:33:55.65,1:33:59.02,Default,,0,0,0,,那个晚上我们因为这个名字笑了好久\N{\rEng}Yeah. We laughed about it all night long.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:59.02,1:34:01.82,Default,,0,0,0,,- 因为她正在做的…… - 哦 天啊\N{\rEng}- Because what she was doing... - Oh my God.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:02.76,1:34:06.96,Default,,0,0,0,,-Coxman有个亲戚 -而且他没有告诉警察\N{\rEng}- Coxman had a relative. - And he hasn't spoken with the cops.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:06.96,1:34:10.20,Default,,0,0,0,,我应该付你多少钱？\N{\rEng}Well... how much did my guy offer you?
Dialogue: 0,1:34:10.20,1:34:11.60,Default,,0,0,0,,1万块\N{\rEng}Ten grand.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:12.27,1:34:13.90,Default,,0,0,0,,那就1万块\N{\rEng}Ten grand it is.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:08.09,1:35:10.06,Default,,0,0,0,,嗨 看他啊\N{\rEng}Hey! Hey, check him out.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:10.73,1:35:13.83,Default,,0,0,0,,你疯了 雪崩！\N{\rEng}- You're crazy, Avalanche!
Dialogue: 0,1:35:15.73,1:35:16.97,Default,,0,0,0,,你确定你以前做过这个？\N{\rEng}You sure you've done this before?
Dialogue: 0,1:35:17.94,1:35:19.44,Default,,0,0,0,,我天生会飞 白娃子\N{\rEng}I was born to fly, white boy.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:57.88,1:36:01.28,Default,,0,0,0,,你儿子在我手上 想要看到他的话自己过来\N{\rEng}I have your son. If you wanna see him alive, come alone.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:01.28,1:36:03.01,Default,,0,0,0,,行 行 我知道怎么办\N{\rEng}Yeah, yeah.I know how it's done.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:03.98,1:36:05.38,Default,,0,0,0,,你要多少钱？\N{\rEng}So, how much do you want for him?
Dialogue: 0,1:36:06.69,1:36:11.72,Default,,0,0,0,,你来之后再说\N{\rEng}We'll talk about that when you get here. 2210 Quarry Road. Kehoe.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:12.29,1:36:17.03,Default,,0,0,0,,我才离开丹佛 需要大约3个小时\N{\rEng}I'm just leaving Denver. It's gonna take me about three hours.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:47.33,1:36:48.46,Default,,0,0,0,,天啊\N{\rEng}Jesus Christ.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:56.17,1:36:57.20,Default,,0,0,0,,妈的\N{\rEng}Son of a...
Dialogue: 0,1:37:05.45,1:37:08.48,Default,,0,0,0,,- 嗨 - 嗨 休班吗？\N{\rEng}-  Hey. - Hey. Taking a day off?
Dialogue: 0,1:37:09.15,1:37:12.02,Default,,0,0,0,,-主路需要清理 - 我很快就过去\N{\rEng}- Main road could use a plow. - I'll get to it soon.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:14.62,1:37:16.56,Default,,0,0,0,,我侄子 来玩儿\N{\rEng}My nephew. Visiting.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:17.36,1:37:19.92,Default,,0,0,0,,在镇上有亲戚一定很舒服\N{\rEng}Must be a comfort to have family in town.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:19.93,1:37:21.96,Default,,0,0,0,,我们在你们家门口看到很多车\N{\rEng}We saw all the cars at your place.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:25.50,1:37:26.43,Default,,0,0,0,,是的\N{\rEng}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:34.58,1:37:35.54,Default,,0,0,0,,看这个\N{\rEng}Look at this.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:37.38,1:37:39.55,Default,,0,0,0,,- 现在我们终于知道他的目的了\N{\rEng}- So now we know he's banging a hippie.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:39.55,1:37:42.15,Default,,0,0,0,,卡车上有公司名字\N{\rEng}On the truck. The company name.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:43.32,1:37:46.29,Default,,0,0,0,,- 开放之路 - 4英里远\N{\rEng}- Open Road. - It's four miles away.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:47.46,1:37:49.09,Default,,0,0,0,,-带上人 -出发\N{\rEng}- Get the men. - Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:58.93,1:38:02.14,Default,,0,0,0,,- 太有趣了 - 我需要你\N{\rEng}- That was so much fun! - I need you...
Dialogue: 0,1:38:02.57,1:38:04.01,Default,,0,0,0,,坐在这里\N{\rEng}to sit here...
Dialogue: 0,1:38:04.94,1:38:07.28,Default,,0,0,0,,直到有人过来找你\N{\rEng}and wait till someone comes to get you.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:21.12,1:38:23.59,Default,,0,0,0,,他们去开放之路车库了\N{\rEng}- They're headed to Open Road Garage. - Again. Say what?
Dialogue: 0,1:38:25.53,1:38:27.40,Default,,0,0,0,,开放之路车库\N{\rEng}Open Road Garage. （看来这就是忠诚的代价）
Dialogue: 0,1:38:29.60,1:38:31.03,Default,,0,0,0,,在 Old Bend路上\N{\rEng}On Old Bend Road.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:04.24,1:39:05.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Ryan!
Dialogue: 0,1:39:05.50,1:39:08.37,Default,,0,0,0,,快点 进去\N{\rEng}Come on. Inside. Come on, move.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:08.37,1:39:11.54,Default,,0,0,0,,- 为什么你带着步枪 -照我说的做 上楼 快\N{\rEng}- Why do you have a rifle? - Just do what I say. Up the stairs, move.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:13.18,1:39:14.38,Default,,0,0,0,,上阁楼\N{\rEng}Get in the cabinet.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:17.48,1:39:19.08,Default,,0,0,0,,为什么生我的气？\N{\rEng}Why are you mad at me?
Dialogue: 0,1:39:19.72,1:39:21.99,Default,,0,0,0,,我没有生你的气 只是……\N{\rEng}I'm not mad at you. It's just...
Dialogue: 0,1:39:22.62,1:39:25.42,Default,,0,0,0,,你能按照我说的做真的很重要\N{\rEng}It's just really important you do what I say.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:27.06,1:39:28.16,Default,,0,0,0,,你是个好孩子\N{\rEng}You're a good kid.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:29.19,1:39:31.46,Default,,0,0,0,,- 什么？- 我说过了不要动\N{\rEng}- What? - I said don't move.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:15.87,1:41:17.74,Default,,0,0,0,,终于\N{\rEng}The last Coxman.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:23.31,1:41:26.05,Default,,0,0,0,,我儿子呢？\N{\rEng}Where is my son?
Dialogue: 0,1:41:28.42,1:41:32.29,Default,,0,0,0,,我的业务很有创新性 但是我是一个老派的人物\N{\rEng}My business can get very creative, but I'm an old fashioned kind of guy.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:32.29,1:41:34.19,Default,,0,0,0,,我喜欢让事情简单\N{\rEng}I like to keep things simple.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:35.19,1:41:39.76,Default,,0,0,0,,如果需要我再问你一次 我就会拔出你的指甲\N{\rEng}So if I have to ask you again, I'm gonna pull out your fingernails...
Dialogue: 0,1:41:39.76,1:41:43.30,Default,,0,0,0,,切下你的手指 剁掉你的手\N{\rEng}cut off your fingers, chop off your hands...
Dialogue: 0,1:41:43.57,1:41:45.57,Default,,0,0,0,,削下你的鼻子\N{\rEng}and hack off your nose.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:49.71,1:41:51.57,Default,,0,0,0,,关于鼻子的那个部分\N{\rEng}Oh, and that part about the nose,
Dialogue: 0,1:41:51.57,1:41:53.91,Default,,0,0,0,,你会很不喜欢的\N{\rEng}you are really not gonna like that part.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:53.91,1:41:55.84,Default,,0,0,0,,你不配你的儿子\N{\rEng}You don't deserve your son.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:59.38,1:42:00.52,Default,,0,0,0,,带他到车库\N{\rEng}Take him to the garage.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:01.38,1:43:02.78,Default,,0,0,0,,混蛋！\N{\rEng}Bastard!
Dialogue: 0,1:47:00.99,1:47:04.13,Default,,0,0,0,,有个孩子开着铲雪车朝Kehoe去了\N{\rEng}Got a kid driving a snow blower headed towards Kehoe.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:20.51,1:47:22.41,Default,,0,0,0,,带个口信\N{\rEng}Get a message...
Dialogue: 0,1:47:22.98,1:47:24.42,Default,,0,0,0,,给Aya \N{\rEng}to Aya.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:28.92,1:47:30.52,Default,,0,0,0,,告诉我的老婆\N{\rEng}Tell my wife...
Dialogue: 0,1:47:33.96,1:47:35.56,Default,,0,0,0,,告诉她 她是一个……\N{\rEng}tell her she's a...
Dialogue: 0,1:48:02.72,1:48:04.09,Default,,0,0,0,,你在干什么？\N{\rEng}What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,1:48:04.82,1:48:05.82,Default,,0,0,0,,我的工作\N{\rEng}My job.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.10,0:00:30.10,Default,,0,0,0,,
